hadiths[289]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas baithe hue the ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Abhi tumhare paas ek jannati aadmi aayega.' Kaha ke Ansar ka ek aadmi aaya, us ki daadhi se wuzu ka pani tapak raha tha, apne joote baayen haath mein latkaaye hue tha. Jab agla din aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Abhi tumhare paas ek jannati aadmi aayega.' To wohi aadmi aaya aur us ki wohi pehli wali kaifiyat thi. Jab teesra din hua to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phir wahi farmaya, to wohi aadmi apni pehli haalat par aaya. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) uth kar chale gaye to Abdullah bin Amr [bin Aas] us ke peeche ho liye aur us se kaha ke main ne apne baap se jhagda kiya aur qasam uthayi hai ke main teen raatein us ke paas nahin thehroon ga, agar aap [muddat] poori hone tak mujhe apne paas rakh sakte hain to aisa zaroor karein, us ne kaha ke theek hai. Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte the ke main teen raatein us aadmi ke saath raha, woh raat mein kuch qiyam na karta, haan jab bistar par pehlu badalta to Allah ka zikr karta aur takbeer [Allahu Akbar] kehta, yahan tak ke namaz-e-fajr ke liye uthta aur mukammal wuzu karta. Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya ke mazeed baraan woh khair baat hi kehta hua sunayi deta tha. Chunacha jab teen raatein guzar gayein to main qareeb tha ke us ke amal ko haqeer jaanta, main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke bande! Baat yeh hai ke mere aur mere baap ke darmiyan koi ghussa aur ranjish nahin hui, lekin main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko teen dafa teen majalis mein farmate hue suna ke 'Abhi tumhare paas ek jannati aadmi aayega.' To teenon martaba aap hi aaye the. Main ne irada kiya ke aap ke paas rahoon aur aap ke amal ka mushahida karoon, phir us amal ko apnaoon, lekin main ne aap ko koi bada amal karte hue nahin dekha, phir aap ko us maqam par kis cheez ne pohncha diya ke jo kuch bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya hai? Us ne kaha ke wohi kuch hai jo tum dekh chuke ho. Main wahan se chal pada, jab main palta to us ne mujhe aawaz di aur kaha ke hai to wohi kuch jo tum dekh chuke ho, albatta main kabhi kisi Musalman ke baare mein, apne dil mein keena nahin rakhta aur na hi kisi khair o bhalayi par, jo us ko Allah Ta'ala ne marhamat farmayi hai, hasad karta hoon, is par Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke yahi woh amal hai jis ne aap ko is maqam par la khada kiya aur isi amal ki hum mein taqat nahin hai."
"2","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saamne ek aadmi ka zikr kiya aur kaha: Jab tak woh na khaaye [koi] nahin khaata, aur jab tak us ke liye sawari tayyar na ki jaaye woh rawana nahin hota. To Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum ne us ki gheebat ki.' Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne to wohi kaha jo us mein hai. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum ne apne bhai mein jo hai us ka zikr kiya to yahi tumhare [gunahgaar hone ke] liye kaafi hai.'"
"3","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab koi Musalman apne beemar bhai ki iyadat karta hai ya us se mulaqat karta hai to Allah us se kehta hai: Tu achha ho gaya, tera chalna achha ho gaya, aur [Allah ne] tere liye jannat mein ek maqam tayyar kar diya.'"
"4","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya: Ek aadmi doosre gaon mein apne ek bhai se milne gaya, to Allah ne us ke raaste mein ek farishta muqarrar farma diya. Jab woh us ke paas pohncha to farishte ne kaha: Kahaan ka irada hai? Us ne kaha: Is basti mein apne ek bhai se milne ka irada hai. Us ne kaha: Kya us ne tujh par koi ehsan kiya hai [jis ka badla] dene ja rahe ho? Kaha: Nahin, main sirf Allah ke liye us se muhabbat karta hoon. Us ne kaha: Main Allah ki taraf se tere liye paighaam le kar bheja gaya hoon: Yaqeenan Allah bhi tujh se muhabbat karta hai, jaisa tu us se [us ke liye] muhabbat karta hai."
"5","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Nabi-e-Akram (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah Ta'ala qiyamat ke din farmayega: Mere jalal ke liye aapas mein muhabbat karne wale kahaan hain? Aaj main unhein apne saaye mein jagah doon ga, jis din mere saaye ke siwa koi saaya nahin hai.'"
"6","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jab tum mein se koi apne saathi se muhabbat kare to us ke paas, us ke ghar aaye aur use bataye ke beshak woh Allah ke liye us se muhabbat karta hai.' [Abu Salim Al-Jaishani kehte hain:] Isi liye main tumhare (Abu Umayyah ke) paas tumhare ghar mein isi wajah se aaya hoon."
"7","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Malik Al-Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz poori ki to chehra logon ki taraf pher kar farmaya: 'Ae logo! Suno, samjho aur jaan lo ke beshak Allah ke kuch bande aise hain jo na nabi hain na shaheed; [phir bhi] un ki majlison aur Allah se qurbat ki wajah se nabi aur shaheed un par rashk [ghibta] karenge.' To door se aaya ek dehati aadmi ghutnon ke bal baitha aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf haath badha kar kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Logon mein se kuch log jo na nabi hain na shaheed, aur nabi aur shaheed un ki majlison aur Allah se qurbat ki wajah se un par rashk karenge — un ke ausaaf hamein bayan karein, un ka huliya hamein batayein. Is dehati ke sawal par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka chehra khushi se roshan ho gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh mukhtalif ilaqon aur bikhri qabeelon ke gumnaam log honge; un ke darmiyan koi qareebi rishtedaari nahin jo unhein jodti ho; unhon ne Allah ke liye aapas mein muhabbat ki aur usi mein ek doosre ke saath mukhlis rahe. Allah qiyamat ke din un ke liye noor ke mimbar banayega aur unhein un par bithayega; un ke chehron aur kapdon ko noor bana dega. Qiyamat ke din log dare hue honge, lekin woh nahin darenge. Wahi Allah ke dost hain — un par na koi khauf hoga na woh ghamgeen honge.'"
"8","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Beshak jo log Allah ke jalal ke liye aapas mein muhabbat karte hain, woh Allah ke arsh ke saaye mein honge, jis din us ke saaye ke siwa koi saaya nahin hoga.'"
"9","[AI-translation] Shurahbil bin As-Simt ne Amr bin Abasah As-Sulami (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Ae Ibne Abasah! Kya aap mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se koi hadees sunayenge jo aap ne khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni ho — jis mein koi ziyadati ya jhoot na ho, aur aap ke siwa kisi aur ne sun kar aap ko na sunayi ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak Allah farmata hai: 'Main ne apni muhabbat un ke liye wajib kar di jo meri khatir aapas mein muhabbat karte hain; main ne apni muhabbat un ke liye wajib kar di jo meri khatir ek doosre se judte hain; main ne apni muhabbat un ke liye wajib kar di jo meri khatir ek doosre se milte hain; main ne apni muhabbat un ke liye wajib kar di jo meri khatir ek doosre par kharch karte hain; aur main ne apni muhabbat un ke liye wajib kar di jo meri khatir ek doosre ki madad karte hain.'"
"10","[AI-translation] Talha [Qurashi] kehte hain: Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Meri do padosanein hain; main kise tohfa doon? Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis ka darwaza tum se zyada qareeb ho, use.'"
"11","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin As-Samit bayan karte hain: Sayyiduna Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! [Us shakhs ke baare mein kya] jo Allah ke liye amal karta hai, aur log us se muhabbat karte hain? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yahi momin ki peshgi basharat hai.'"
"12","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Hamein achha lagta tha jab koi dehati aadmi aata aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal karta. Ek baddu aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Qiyamat kab hogi? Itne mein namaz ki iqamat hui; Aap uthe aur namaz padhayi. Namaz se farigh ho kar Aap ne farmaya: 'Qiyamat ke baare mein sawal karne wala kahaan hai?' Us ne kaha: Main, ae Allah ke Rasul! Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum ne us ke liye kya tayyar kiya hai?' Us ne kaha: Main ne us ke liye zyada namaz-roza tayyar nahin kiya; bas main Allah aur us ke Rasul se muhabbat karta hoon. Aap ne farmaya: 'Aadmi usi ke saath hoga jis se woh muhabbat karta hai.' [Anas kehte hain:] Islam ke baad Musalman kisi cheez par itne khush nahin hue jitne is baat par khush hue."
"13","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jab bhi do shakhs Islam mein aapas mein muhabbat karte hain, phir un ke darmiyan judayi pad jaati hai, to yeh zaroor un mein se kisi ek ke kiye hue gunah ki wajah se hoti hai.'"
"14","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain: Ae logo! Aapas mein reham karo; kyunke main ne apne kaanon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Musalman ek shakhs ki tarah hain; jab us ka koi uzw takleef mein hota hai to saara jism us ke liye bechain ho jaata hai.'"
"15","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Baghawat [zulm] aur qata-e-rehmi se badh kar koi gunah nahin jo zyada haqdaar ho ke aakhirat mein us ke liye jo zakheera hai, us ke saath duniya mein bhi Allah us ke karne wale ko jald saza de.'"
"16","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ek banda kaanton ki ek daali ki wajah se jannat mein dakhil hua, jo Musalmanon ke raaste mein thi; us ne use hata diya.'"
"17","[AI-translation] Bahz apne walid Hakeem se, woh apne dada [Muawiyah bin Haidah] se riwayat karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Halakat hai us ke liye jo baat kare aur jhoot bole taake logon ko hansaye; halakat hai us ke liye, halakat hai us ke liye, halakat hai us ke liye.'"
"18","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak banda ek baat kehta hai — use sirf logon ko hansane ke liye kehta hai; us ki wajah se woh aasman-zameen ke darmiyani faasle se bhi door [jahannam mein] girta hai. Aur beshak us ki zubaan ka phisalna us ke qadmon ke phisalne se zyada sakht hai.'"
"19","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aadmi ke gunahgaar hone ke liye yahi kaafi hai ke woh har suni hui baat bayan kare.'"
"20","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab agle-pichhle sab jama honge to kaha jayega: Yeh falan bin falan ki ghaddari [ka nishan] hai.'"
"21","[AI-translation] Abu Huzaifah — Abdullah [bin Masood] ke saathiyon mein se ek — Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) se bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saamne kisi aurat ya mard ki naqal [mazaq] utaari. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe kisi ki naqal utaarna pasand nahin — chaahe is ke badle mujhe itna-itna [maal] hi kyun na mile; main ise bahut bada [gunah] samajhta hoon.'"
"22","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Umamah Al-Bahili (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Sayyiduna Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne apni nayi qamees mangayi aur pehni; mera khayal nahin ke woh un ki hansli tak pohnchi thi — yahan tak ke unhon ne kaha: 'Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe [yeh libas] pehnaya, jis se main apna satar dhakta hoon aur apni zindagi mein zeenat hasil karta hoon.' Phir kaha: Kya tum jaante ho main ne yeh kyun kaha? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha: Unhon ne apne naye kapde mangaye aur pehne — mera khayal hai woh un ki hansli tak pohnche the — yahan tak ke Unhon ne wahi kaha jo main ne kaha. Phir farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Jab bhi koi Musalman banda naya kapda pehne, phir wahi kahe jo main ne kaha, phir apne utaare hue kapdon mein se puraane phate kapde ki taraf jaaye aur use kisi Musalman miskeen faqeer ko pehnaye — sirf Allah ke liye pehnaye — to woh Allah ki hifazat, zamanat aur hamsayegi mein rahega, jab tak us mein se ek dhaaga bhi us par baqi rahe — zinda ho ya murda, zinda ho ya murda, zinda ho ya murda.'"
"23","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya — hum us waqt Aap ke paas the: 'Khushkhabri ho ajnabiyon ke liye, khushkhabri ho ajnabiyon ke liye!' Poocha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Ajnabi kaun hain? Farmaya: 'Bahut se bure logon mein thode se nek log; un ki nafarmani karne wale, un ki ita'at karne walon se zyada honge.' Aur ek aur din hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas the, jab sooraj tulu hua; farmaya: 'Qareeb hai ke qiyamat ke din meri ummat ke kuch log aayenge, un ka noor sooraj ki roshni jaisa hoga.' Hum ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Woh kaun honge? Farmaya: 'Ghareeb muhajir — jin ke zariye napasandeeda cheezon se bacha jaata hai; un mein se koi marta hai, jabke us ki haajat us ke seene mein [adhoori] reh jaati hai; unhein zameen ke konon se jama kiya jayega.'"
"24","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Hisham bin Aamir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Kisi Musalman ke liye teen raaton se zyada kisi Musalman ko chhodna [talluq tod rakhna] halal nahin. Woh donon haq se hate hue hain jab tak apne qata-e-talluq par qayam hain; aur un mein se jo pehle laute — us ka lautne mein pehal karna us ke liye kaffara hoga. Aur agar woh salam kare magar doosra qabool na kare aur us ke salam ka jawab na de, to farishte us ki [salam karne wale ki] taraf se jawab dete hain, aur shaitan doosre ki taraf se jawab deta hai. Aur agar woh donon is qata-e-talluq par mar gaye to donon ek saath jannat mein dakhil nahin honge' — mera khayal hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kabhi bhi.'"
"25","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Sahl As-Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Hum [Quran] tilawat kar rahe the; achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aaye aur farmaya: 'Sab tareef Allah ke liye; Kitab ek hai, aur tum mein surkh o siyah [har rang ke log] hain. Aise log aane se pehle [Quran] padho jo ise padhenge — is ke huroof ko aise seedha karenge jaise teer seedha kiya jaata hai — lekin woh un ki hansli se aage nahin badhega. Woh is ka ajr jaldi chahenge, der nahin karenge.'"
"26","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah logon se chheen kar ilm nahin uthayega; balke ulama ko utha kar ilm uthayega; yahan tak ke jab koi aalim baqi nahin rakhega to log jahilon ko peshwa bana lenge; un se sawal kiye jayenge aur woh baghair ilm ke fatwe denge — khud gumrah honge aur doosron ko gumrah karenge.'"
"27","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jis raat mujhe Meraj karayi gayi, main ne kuch logon ko dekha jin ke honth qainchiyon se kaate ja rahe the. Main ne kaha: Ae Jibreel [Alaihissalam]! Yeh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh tumhari ummat ke khateeb hain — jo logon ko neki ka hukm dete hain, lekin khud ko bhool jaate hain; halanke woh Kitab ki tilawat karte hain. To kya woh samajhte nahin?'"
"28","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Gunah kya hai? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Jo tere seene mein bechaini paida kare, use chhod de.' Us ne poocha: Iman kya hai? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Jab tera gunah tujhe nagawar ho aur teri neki tujhe khush kare, to tu momin hai.'"
"29","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Fadalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajjatul-Wada ke mauqe par farmaya: 'Kya main tumhein momin ke baare mein na bataoon? Woh jis se log apne maal aur jaan ke baare mein mehfooz hain. Aur Musalman woh hai jis ki zubaan aur haath se log mehfooz hain. Aur mujahid woh hai jo Allah ki ita'at mein apne nafs se jihad karta hai. Aur muhajir woh hai jo gunahon aur ghaltiyon ko chhod deta hai.'"
"30","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis mein teen khoobiyan hongi, woh iman ki mithaas payega: woh kisi se muhabbat kare to sirf Allah ke liye muhabbat kare; Allah aur us ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use har cheez se zyada mehboob hon; aur Allah ke use [kufr se] najaat dene ke baad kufr ki taraf lautne ke bajaye aag mein daala jaana use zyada pasand ho.'"
"31","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zyada haseen kuch nahin dekha — goya Aap ke [Alaihissalam] chehre mein sooraj chal raha tha. Aur Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se tez chalne wala koi nahin dekha — goya Aap ke [Alaihissalam] liye zameen lapet di gayi thi. Hum thak jaate, lekin Aap ko [Alaihissalam] koi takleef na hoti."
"32","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Sa'di (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Kya mujhe yeh khabar nahin pohnchi ke tum [hakim ke taur par] logon ke bahut se kaam karte ho, phir jab tumhein ujrat di jaati hai to use qabool nahin karte?' Unhon ne kaha: Jee haan. Umar ne poocha: Is mein tumhari niyyat kya hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: Main maaldar hoon; mere paas ghode aur bahut se ghulam hain; aur main chahta hoon ke mera kaam Musalmanon ke liye sadqa ho. Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Aisa na karo. Main bhi wahi karta tha jo tum karte ho; lekin jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe ujrat di to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Yeh us ko dein jo mujh se zyada is ka muhtaj hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lo; ya to ise apna maal banao ya sadqa karo. Aur is maal mein se jo tumhare paas aaye — jis ka tum hirs bhi na rakhte ho aur maangte bhi nahin — to use lo. Aur jo aisa na ho, us ke peeche apna nafs na lagao.'"
"33","[AI-translation] Qais bin Bishr At-Taghlibi ne kaha: Mere walid Damishq mein Sayyiduna Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ke saathi the; aur Damishq mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein ek shakhs the, jinhein Ibne Hanzalah [Rahimahullah] kaha jaata tha. Woh tanhayi-pasand the, logon ki majlison mein bahut kam baithte the. Woh sirf namaz mein mashghool rehte; aur jab namaz se farigh hote to un ka ek hi kaam hota — Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah aur Allahu Akbar kehna — ghar pohnchne tak. Ek din woh hamare paas se guzre — hum us waqt Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ke saath the. Unhon ne hamein salam kiya; Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: Hamein kuch aisa sunayein jo hamein fayeda de aur aap ko nuqsan na de. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hum se farmaya: 'Beshak tum apne bhaiyon ke paas ja rahe ho; is liye apne kapde durust rakho, apni sawariyan durust rakho — taake logon mein numayan ho. Beshak Allah behayai aur jaan-boojh kar ki gayi badkalami ko pasand nahin karta.'"
"34","[AI-translation] Usair bin Jabir ne kaha: Hum Koofa mein apne ek muhaddis ke paas baithte the. Jab log chale jaate to chand aadmi reh jaate; un mein ek shakhs the, jin jaisi baat kehte main ne kisi ko nahin suna; main un se muhabbat karne laga, mere dil mein un ki muhabbat baith gayi. Isi haal mein achanak main ne unhein kho diya; main ne apne saathiyon se kaha: Woh shakhs — jo hamare saath baithte the — kya tum mein se koi unhein jaanta hai? Ek shakhs ne kaha: Haan, woh Uwais Al-Qarani hain. Main ne kaha: Kya un ke ghar ka raasta bataoge? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main un ke saath gaya, un ke darwaze par barche ki tarah [seedha] pohncha, aur darwaza khatkhataya. Woh nikle; main ne kaha: Ae bhai! Hamare paas aane se kis ne roka? Unhon ne kaha: Nangapan [libas na hona]; tumhare paas aane ke liye mere paas kuch nahin; mere paas sirf ek chaadar hai. Main ne kaha: Yeh chaadar pehen lein. Unhon ne kaha: Aisa na karein; main yeh chaadar pehnoon ga to woh mujhe takleef denge. Main unhein manata raha, yahan tak ke unhon ne pehen li. Woh un ke saamne nikle; unhon ne kaha: Kis ne use us ki chaadar ke baare mein dhoka diya? Woh aaye aur use utaar kar rakh diya. Main un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Is shakhs se tumhein kya chahiye? Tum ne unhein takleef di hai; aadmi ek baar pehenta hai, doosri baar utaarta hai? Main ne sakht zubaan mein unhein malamat ki. Un ke saathiyon mein ek shakhs tha jo un ka mazaq udaata tha. Koofiyon ka wafd Sayyidina Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya; woh shakhs bhi wafd mein aaya. Umar ne kaha: Yahan Qaraniyon mein se koi hai? Woh shakhs aaya; Umar ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hum se farmaya: 'Tumhare paas Yaman ka ek shakhs aayega, jise Uwais Al-Qarani kaha jaata hai; Yaman mein apni maan ke siwa woh kisi ko nahin chhodega; us ke jism mein safedi thi, us ne Allah se dua ki, Allah ne use door kar diya — deenar ya dirham ki jagah ke barabar ke siwa. Tum mein se jo use paaye, use kaho ke tumhare liye istighfar kare.' [Umar] ne kaha: Woh yahan hamare paas aaye; main ne kaha: Tum kaun ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main Uwais hoon. Main ne kaha: Yaman mein kise chhod aaye? Unhon ne kaha: Apni maan ko. Main ne kaha: Tumhare jism mein safedi thi, tum ne Allah se dua ki, Allah ne use door kar diya — deenar ya dirham ki jagah ke barabar ke siwa? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main ne kaha: Mere liye istighfar karo. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Ameerul-Momineen! Kya mujh jaisa aap jaise [shakhs] ke liye istighfar karta hai? [Umar] ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Tum mere bhai ho; mujhe na chhodo. Woh mujh se chhoot kar chale gaye; baad mein mujhe khabar mili ke woh Koofa mein tumhare paas aaye hain. Woh shakhs Umar ki baat ke muqable mein unhein haqeer jaan-ne laga; main ne kaha: Tum hamare darmiyan aisi baat kehte ho, aur hum inhein nahin jaante? Umar ne kaha: Haan, woh aise shakhs hain — woh un ka martaba ghatane lage [unhein kamzor dikhane lage]; unhon ne kaha: Woh shakhs hamare paas hai — hum un ka mazaq udaate hain; unhein Uwais kaha jaata hai. [Umar] ne kaha: Wahi woh hain; unhein pakdo — aur mujhe nahin lagta tum unhein pakad paoge. Woh shakhs gaya, apne ghar jaane se pehle un ke paas dakhil hua; Uwais ne kaha: Yeh tumhari aadat na thi; kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam deta hoon — Umar se meri mulaqat hui; unhon ne aisa-aisa kaha; mere liye istighfar karo. Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhare liye istighfar nahin karoon ga, jab tak tum ahd na karo ke mera mazaq nahin udaoge aur Umar se jo suna, kisi ko nahin bataoge. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhare liye yahi. To unhon ne un ke liye istighfar kiya. Usair kehte hain: Zyada der na guzri ke Koofa mein un ki baat phail gayi. Main un ke paas aaya; kaha: Ae bhai! Tum to ajeeb ho — aur hamein khabar na thi. Unhon ne kaha: Is mein aisi koi baat na thi jo logon tak pohnchayi jaaye; har bande ko us ke amal hi ka badla milega. Jab baat phail gayi to woh bhaag gaye."
"35","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ki sau rehmatein hain. Un mein se ek rehmat us ne jinnat, insanon, chaupayon aur keedon mein utaari — jis se woh aapas mein shafqat o narmi dikhate hain; isi wajah se darinda apne bachche par mamta dikhata hai. Aur baqi ninyanwe rehmaton se woh qiyamat ke din apne bandon par reham farmayega.'"
"36","[AI-translation] Damdam bin Hawas ne kaha: Main Madina ki masjid mein dakhil hua; ek buzurg ne mujhe pukara aur kaha: Ae Yamami! Ae Yamami! Idhar aao — main unhein pehchanta na tha. Unhon ne kaha: Kisi aadmi ko kabhi na kehna: Allah tumhein kabhi nahin bakhshega, tumhein jannat mein dakhil nahin karega. Main ne kaha: Aap kaun hain — Allah aap par reham kare? Unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu). Main ne kaha: Yeh baatein — jab hum mein se koi ghussa hota hai to apne gharwalon, ya biwi, ya khadim ke baare mein kehta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Bani Israil mein do aadmi the jo aapas mein muhabbat karte the. Ek ibadat mein mehnat karta, aur doosra — goya Nabi [Alaihissalam] farma rahe the — gunahgaar tha. Ibadat karne wala kehta: Tum jis haal mein ho, us se baaz aao, ruk jaao! Woh kehta: Mujhe aur mere Rabb ko chhod do — yahan tak ke ek din us ne use gunah mein paya, use bada samjha aur kaha: Ruk jaao! Us ne kaha: Mujhe aur mere Rabb ko chhod do — kya tum mujh par nigehban bana kar bheje gaye ho? Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Allah tumhein kabhi nahin bakhshega, tum kabhi jannat mein dakhil nahin hoge! Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne un donon ke paas ek farishta bheja, jis ne un ki roohein qabz kein; donon us ke paas jama hue. Us ne gunahgaar se kaha: Meri rehmat se jannat mein dakhil ho; aur doosre se kaha: Kya tu mere bande se meri rehmat rokne ki taqat rakhta hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin, ae Rabb! Us ne kaha: Use jahannam le jaao.' Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Us ne aisa kalima kaha jis ne us ki duniya-aakhirat tabah kar di."
"37","[AI-translation] Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke aazad-karda ghulam Humran bayan karte hain: Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke saamne se paani ka ek mitti ka bartan guzara gaya. Unhon ne use mangaya, wuzu kiya aur mukammal wuzu kiya. Phir kaha: Agar main ne ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek, do ya teen baar bhi suna hota, tab bhi tumhein na sunata. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna [beshumar baar]: 'Jo banda wuzu kare aur mukammal wuzu kare, phir namaz ke liye khada ho — Allah zaroor us ke is namaz aur agli namaz ke darmiyani gunah bakhsh deta hai.' Muhammad bin Ka'b ne kaha: Jab bhi main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kisi sahabi se hadees sunta to use Quran mein talash karta. Ise talash kiya, paya: [Beshak hum ne tumhein khuli fatah di — taake Allah tumhare agle-pichhle gunah bakhsh de aur tum par apni nemat tamam kare — Surah Fatah 1-2]. To jaana ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nemat tamam nahin hui jab tak un ke gunah bakhsh nahin diye gaye. Phir yeh aayat padhi: [Jab tum namaz ke liye khade ho to apne chehre aur kohniyon tak haath dho — Surah Maida 6]. To jaana ke Allah ne un par nemat tamam nahin ki jab tak unhein bakhsh nahin diya."
"38","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Namazein gunahon ka kaffara hain, namazein gunahon ka kaffara hain; chaho to tilawat karo: [Beshak nekiyan buraiyon ko mita deti hain; yeh naseehat pakadne walon ke liye naseehat hai — Surah Hood 114].'"
"39","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Wasilah bin Asqa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah farmata hai: Mera banda mere baare mein jaisa guman karta hai, main waisa hi hoon; woh mere baare mein jaisa chahe, guman kare.'"
"40","[AI-translation] Sasa'ah bin Muawiyah [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Main Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se mila. Unhon ne poocha: Kahaan se ho? Main ne kaha: Iraq walon mein se. Unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhein koi hadees na sunaoon jo tumhare baad walon ko bhi fayeda de? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahin? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Beshak qiyamat ke din logon se sab se pehle jis cheez ka hisab liya jayega, woh namaz hai. Allah farishton se kahega: Mere bande ki namaz dekho. Mukammal hui to mukammal likhi jayegi; naqis hui to Allah Ta'ala — apne hilm o fazl se — farmayega: Mere bande ki taraf lautao; dekho us ke koi nawafil hain ya nahin. Nawafil hue to un se us ka farz mukammal kiya jayega.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Phir baqi aamal bhi isi tarah liye jayenge.'"
"41","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdurrahman bin Abi Amrah Al-Ansari apne walid [Abu Amrah] se bayan karte hain: Hum ek ghazwe mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath the; logon ko bhookh lagi. Logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apni kuch sawariyan zibah karne ki ijazat maangi; kaha: Kya is se hamari [manzil tak] rasayi hogi? Jab Umar bin Khattab ne dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhein apni kuch sawariyan zibah karne ki ijazat nahin denge, kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Kal dushman se bhooke, paidal milenge to hamara kya hoga? Agar aap chahein — ae Allah ke Rasul — logon ko bache-khuche zaad ke saath bulayein, use jama karein, phir us mein barkat ke liye Allah se dua karein; beshak Allah aap ki dua se hamein [manzil tak] pohncha dega — ya kaha: Aap ki dua se hamein barkat dega. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko bache-khuche zaad ke saath bulaya; log mutthi-bhar khana aur us se zyada laane lage; jo sab se zyada laya, woh khajoor ka ek sa' [laya]. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use jama kiya, phir khade hue aur Allah ne jo chaha maangne ki dua ki. Phir lashkar ko bartanon samet bula kar bharne ka hukm diya. Lashkar mein koi bartan baqi na raha jo na bhara gaya — aur utna hi [zaad] bach bhi gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hanse, yahan tak ke Aap ki daadhein nazar aayein. Farmaya: 'Main gawahi deta hoon ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, aur main gawahi deta hoon ke main Allah ka Rasul hoon. Jo banda in donon [gawahiyon] par iman rakhte hue Allah se milega, qiyamat ke din us se jahannam rok di jayegi.'"
"42","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Rifa'ah Al-Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath aaye; jab Al-Qadeed [ya Qudaid] naami jagah pohnche to hum mein se kuch log gharwalon ke paas jaane ki ijazat maangne lage; Aap ne unhein ijazat di. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd ki, [khair ki baat] kahi, phir farmaya: 'Main Allah ke saamne gawahi deta hoon: Jo banda mare — gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, Muhammad [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] us ke bande aur Rasul hain — dil se sachchayi ke saath, phir sabit-qadam rahe — Allah zaroor use jannat mein dakhil karega. Mere Aziz o Jaleel Rabb ne mujh se wada kiya hai ke woh meri ummat ke sattar hazaar ko baghair hisab, baghair azab jannat mein dakhil karega. Aur mujhe pukhta ummeed hai ke tum aur tumhari nek biwiyan o aulad jannat ke makanon mein jagah lene se pehle woh dakhil nahin honge.' Aur farmaya: 'Jab aadhi raat ya ek-tihayi raat guzar jaati hai to Aziz o Jaleel Allah duniya ke aasman par nuzool farmata hai; farmata hai: Mere bandon ke paas mere siwa koi maangne [dene wala] nahin. Kaun hai jo mujh se bakhshish maange — main use bakhsh doon? Kaun hai jo mujh se dua kare — main us ki dua qabool karoon? Kaun hai jo mujh se maange — main use doon? Subah phatne tak.'"
"43","[AI-translation] Mahmood bin Rabi' [Raziyallahu anhu] samajhte the ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko samjha tha — jab unhon ne woh ghoont [paani] samjha tha jo Aap ne un ke ghar ki dol se le kar kulli kar ke phenka tha. Kaha: Main ne Sayyiduna Itban bin Malik Al-Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) — jo Banu Salim mein se the — kehte suna: Main apni qaum Banu Salim ki imamat karta tha. Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Meri beenayi kamzor ho gayi hai, aur sailab mere aur meri qaum ki masjid ke darmiyan hail hote hain; main chahta hoon ke aap — ae Allah ke Rasul — aakar mere ghar mein ek jagah namaz padhein, main use masjid bana loon? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'InshaAllah karoon ga.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah — din chadhne ke baad — mere paas aaye; Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) Aap ke saath the. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ijazat maangi; main ne ijazat di. Aap baithne se pehle farmaya: 'Tumhare ghar mein kahaan namaz padhna chahte ho?' Main ne chahi hui jagah ki taraf ishara kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue; hum ne Aap ke peeche safein banayein. Phir Aap ne salam phera, Aap ne salam phera to hum ne bhi salam phera. Farigh ho kar hum ne Aap ko khazeer [gosht-aate ka khana] — jo tayyar tha — khilane ke liye rok liya. Mohalle walon ne suna — woh gharon se apne padosiyon ko bula rahe the — woh jama hue, yahan tak ke ghar bhar gaya. Ek aadmi ne kaha: Malik bin Dukhshun kahaan hai? Hum mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Woh munafiq hai; Allah aur us ke Rasul se muhabbat nahin karta. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aisa na kaho; woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin — is se Aziz o Jaleel Allah ki raza chahta hai.' Us ne kaha: Hum to us ka chehra aur baat munafiqon ki taraf dekhte hain. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phir farmaya: 'Aisa na kaho; woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin — is se Allah ki raza chahta hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Jee haan, ae Allah ke Rasul! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo banda qiyamat ke din aayega — kahega: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin — is se Aziz o Jaleel Allah ki raza chahega — Allah us par jahannam haram kar dega.' Mahmood kehte hain: Main ne yeh ek jama'at ko sunaya — un mein Abu Ayyub the — Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi — un ke us ghazwe mein jis mein woh wafat paye. Main ne kaha: Agar Allah mujhe is ghazwe se salamat lautaye to Itban bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se is ke baare mein poochoon ga. Main ne unhein zinda paya; Eeliya se hajj ya umre ka ihram baandha — yahan tak ke Madina aaya aur Banu Salim ke paas gaya — wahan Itban bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) the — bahut boodhe, beenayi jaati rahi — apni qaum ke imam. Jab unhon ne salam pher kar namaz poori ki to main aaya, salam kiya, ta'aruf karaya; unhon ne mujhe yeh hadees sunayi — jaisi pehli baar sunayi thi. Zuhri kehte hain: Lekin maloom nahin yeh Quran ke faraiz nazil hone se pehle tha ya nahin; kyunke Aziz Allah ne apni kitab mein is kalime ke kehne wale par bahut se faraiz kiye hain — jin ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zikr kiya. Hamein darr hai ke muamla [sakhti ki taraf] badal gaya hai — jo dhoka na khane ki taqat rakhta ho, woh dhoka na khaye."
"44","[AI-translation] Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke sahabi Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Busr (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Kaun-sa amal sab se afzal hai? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Tumhari zubaan hamesha Aziz o Jaleel Allah ke zikr se tar rahe.'"
"45","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah aur Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Jab bhi log jama ho kar Allah ka zikr karte hain, farishte zaroor unhein gher lete hain, sakeena nazil hoti hai, rehmat dhaanp leti hai, aur Allah un ka zikr un ke saamne karta hai jo us ke paas hain — ya'ni farishton ke.'"
"46","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo apne saathiyon ko hansane ke liye kuch kahe, is ki wajah se woh Surayya [Kirttika taron] se bhi door [jahannam mein] girta hai.'"
"47","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab bhi log kisi majlis mein baithein aur us mein Allah ka zikr na karein — to woh majlis zaroor un ke liye hasrat o nadamat hogi. Aur jo thoda-sa chale aur Allah ka zikr bhi na kare, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durood bhi na bheje — to yeh [chalna] bhi zaroor us ke liye hasrat o nadamat hoga.'"
"48","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab bhi log kisi majlis mein baithein — jis mein Allah ka zikr bhi na karein, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durood bhi na bhejein — to woh qiyamat ke din zaroor un ke liye hasrat o nadamat hogi. Chahe to woh unhein bakhsh dega, chahe to is ki wajah se azab dega.'"
"49","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jume ke din khajoor ke tane se peeth laga kar khutba dete the. Jab log badh gaye to Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Mere liye ek mimbar banao.' Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne Aap ke [Alaihissalam] liye mimbar banaya. Bas dukh ka waqt tha — Aap [Alaihissalam] lakdi se mimbar ki taraf chale gaye. Kehte hain: 'Tab woh [tana] rone laga. Allah ki qasam! Woh lakdi roi — jaise baap rota hai.' Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Allah ki qasam! Main masjid mein tha, is ka [rona] sun raha tha. Kehte hain: Allah ki qasam! Woh rota raha yahan tak ke Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mimbar se utre, us ki taraf gaye, use seene se lagaya, phir woh khamosh ho gaya — aur us mein ishtiyaq tha. [Hasan Rahimahullah] kehte hain: Ae Musalmanon ki jama'at! Lakdi ka tana Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye ro raha hai; to jo Aap ki [Alaihissalam] mulaqat ki ummeed rakhte hain, kya woh Aap ki taraf ishtiyaq ke zyada haqdaar nahin?"
"50","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Aamir bin Rabi'ah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo mujh par durood bheje, farishte us ke liye istighfar karte hain — jab tak woh durood bhejta rahe. Banda kam kare ya zyada.'"
"51","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Talha (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din aaye — Aap ke chehre par khushi zahir thi. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Baat yeh hai ke Jibreel [Alaihissalam] mere paas aaye; kaha: Ae Muhammad [Alaihissalam]! Kya tum khush nahin — tumhari ummat ka jo tum par ek baar durood bhejega, main us par das rehmatein bhejoon ga; aur jo tum par ek baar salam bhejega, main us par das salam bhejoon ga?'"
"52","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Masood (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ke kuch farishte hain jo zameen mein ghoomte hain; woh meri ummat ke salam mujh tak pohnchate hain.'"
"53","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Uqbah bin Aamir Al-Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo wuzu kare, achha kare, phir aisi namaz padhe — jis mein na bhoole, na khele — to is se pehle us ne jo [ghalti] ki, woh mita di jayegi.'"
"54","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Fadl bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Namaz do-do rak'at hai. Har do rak'at mein tashahhud [attahiyyat] hai; aajizi, farotni aur narmi ikhtiyar kare. Phir apne donon haath uthaye' — rawi kehte hain: Apne Rabb ki taraf — andarooni rukh chehre ki taraf kar ke — 'Ae mere Rabb! Jo aisa na kare, us ki namaz naqis hai.'"
"55","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein khada ho to rehmat beshak us ke saamne hoti hai; woh kankariyon ko bilkul na chhue.'"
"56","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah apne bande ki taraf mutawajjah rehta hai — jab tak woh namaz mein [ghaflat se] munh na phere. Jab munh pher le to woh bhi us se munh pher leta hai.'"
"57","[AI-translation] Ya'la bin Mamlak [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Unhon ne Sayyidah Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki tilawat aur namaz ke baare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz se tumhara kya wasta? Aap [Alaihissalam] namaz padhte, phir jitni der namaz padhi thi utni der sote; phir jitni der soye the utni der namaz padhte; phir jitni der namaz padhi thi utni der sote. Subah aane tak yahi Aap ki [Alaihissalam] namaz thi. Aur unhon ne Aap ki [Alaihissalam] tilawat bayan ki — achanak woh Aap ki tilawat harf-harf bayan kar rahi thein — har harf ko wazeh o alag kar ke."
"58","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Mikhraq ne kaha: Main ne Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) se kaha: Ae Ummul-Momineen! Kuch log hain jin mein se koi ek raat mein do-teen baar poora Quran padhta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne padha, lekin nahin padha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) saari raat namaz mein khade rehte; Surah Baqarah, Surah Aal-e-Imran aur Surah Nisa padhte. Phir jab basharat ki aayat par guzarte to zaroor dua karte o shauq dikhate; aur jab tambeeh ki aayat par guzarte to zaroor Allah Ta'ala se dua karte o panah maangte."
"59","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sirf do aadmiyon par rashk [ghibta] jayez hai: ek woh jise Allah ne maal diya, woh din ke auqaat mein us mein se kharch karta hai; aur doosra woh jise us ne yeh Quran diya, woh raat ke auqaat mein aur din ke auqaat mein use le kar khada hota hai.'"
"60","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Masood (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Rashk [ghibta] sirf do shakhson par [jayez] hai: ek woh aadmi jise Allah ne maal diya aur use sahi tareeqe se kharch karne ki taufeeq di; aur doosra woh aadmi jise Allah ne hikmat di — woh us se faisla karta hai aur sikhata hai.'"
"61","[AI-translation] Sa'ib bin Yazid ne bayan kiya: Rasulullah [Alaihissalam] ke saamne Shuraih Hadrami ka zikr kiya gaya; Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Woh aisa aadmi hai jo Quran ko takiya nahin banata.'"
"62","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Raat mein ek ghadi hai — koi Musalman banda use paye, khair o bhalayi maange — to zaroor use di jaati hai; aur woh har raat mein hai.'"
"63","[AI-translation] Abu Muslim ne kaha: Main ne Sayyiduna Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: Raat ka kaun-sa hissa [namaz mein] khade hone ke liye sab se achha hai? Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tum ne mujh se jaisa poocha, main ne bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se waisa hi poocha tha; Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: Aadhi raat.' Auf [rawi] shak mein hain; aur use karne wale thode hain."
"64","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar main apni ummat par dushwar na samajhta to zaroor har wuzu par miswak ka aur Isha ki namaz aadhi raat ya ek-tihayi raat tak mu'akhkhar karne ka hukm deta. Baat yeh hai ke jab aadhi raat ya ek-tihayi raat guzar jaati hai' — phir [Nabi Alaihissalam] ne Aziz o Jaleel Allah ke nuzool ka zikr kiya — 'Woh farmata hai: Kaun hai jo mujh se dua kare — main us ki dua qabool karoon? Kaun hai jo mujh se maange — main use doon? Kaun hai jo mujh se bakhshish maange — main use bakhsh doon — sooraj tulu hone tak.'"
"65","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo wuzu ki haalat mein raat guzare, us ke jism se lage kapde mein ek farishta raat guzarta hai. Raat mein jab bhi woh jaage, farishta kehta hai: Ae Allah! Apne falan bande ko bakhsh de; beshak us ne wuzu ki haalat mein raat guzari hai.'"
"66","[AI-translation] Sulaiman At-Taimi [Rahimahullah] ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne bayan kiya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ghulam Ubaid se poocha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farz namazon ke siwa kisi namaz ka hukm diya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Maghrib-Isha ke darmiyan."
"67","[AI-translation] Shuraih bin Hani [Rahimahullah] ne kaha: Main ne Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke baare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Sab namazon mein Isha ki namaz mu'akhkhar hone ki sab se zyada haqdaar thi — jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) guftagu mein mashghool hote. Jab bhi Aap [Alaihissalam] yeh [Isha ki] namaz padh kar mere paas aate to zaroor chaar ya chhe rak'at padhte. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zameen se kisi cheez se kabhi parhez nahin karte the — siwa is ke ke mujhe barish ka din zaroor yaad hai, jab hum ne Aap ke neeche chaatai ya kuch aur bichhayi thi — jaisa rawi ne zikr kiya — ya'ni chamde ka bichhauna — goya main us mein chhed dekh rahi hoon jis se paani nikal raha tha."
"68","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Sa'id bin Mundhir Al-Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Kya main teen raaton mein Quran padh sakta hoon? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar taqat rakhte ho [to padho].' Kehte hain: Woh wafat tak aise hi padhte rahe."
"69","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab bhi mere paas se nikalte to zaroor do rak'at padhte."
"70","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to baithne se pehle do rak'at padhe.'"
"71","[AI-translation] Imam Abdullah bin Mubarak [Rahimahullah] ne Malik bin Anas [Rahimahullah] se isi sanad se aisi hi hadees bayan ki [jaisa oopar zikr hua]."
"72","[AI-translation] Kaseer Al-A'raj ne kaha: Hum 'Zu Sawari' [jagah] mein the; hamare saath Abu Fatimah Al-Azdi the — kasrat-e-sujood se un ki peshani o ghutne kaale ho gaye the. [Woh bayan karte hain: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Mujhe koi amal batayein jis par jama rahoon aur use karoon. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Kasrat-e-sujood ikhtiyar karo; tum Allah ke liye ek sajda karoge to Allah tumhara ek darja buland karega aur is ki wajah se tumhara ek gunah bakhsh dega.']"
"73","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [un ke saath] ek mahina thehre. Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sab kaamon mein raha. Dekha ke jab sooraj dhalta ya jhukta — ya jaisa main ne kaha — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kisi dunyawi kaam mein hote to use chhod dete; soye hote to goya hum unhein is ke liye jagate. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hote, ghusl ya wuzu karte, phir chaar rak'at padhte — mukammal karte, khoobsurat karte, badi sukoon o itminan se padhte. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [hamare ghar se] jaane ka irada karte to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Aap mere paas ek mahina thehre; aur main ne jaan liya ke beshak Aap is se khair o bhalayi se bharpoor hain. Aap ke sab aamal jaanne ke liye Aap ke saath raha [farz aamal qareeb se dekhne ke liye]; dekha ke jab sooraj dhalta ya jhukta to haath mein koi kaam hota to chhod dete, soye hote to jagaye jaate, ghusl ya wuzu karte, phir chaar rak'at padhte — mukammal karte, khoobsurat karte, badi sukoon o itminan se padhte. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak us ghadi is ke liye aasmanon ke darwaze aur jannat ke darwaze khole jaate hain. Jo yeh namaz padhe — main pasand karta hoon ke us ghadi mere liye mere Rabb ki taraf khair o bhalayi oopar uthe.'"
"74","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: Dua hi ibadat hai. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne [aayat] tilawat ki: [Tumhara Rabb kehta hai: Mujhe pukaro, main tumhari dua qabool karoon ga — Surah Mu'min 60]."
"75","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se wahi hadees bayan hui hai."
"76","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdurrahman bin Haris bin Hisham bayan karte hain: Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhuma) masjid mein dakhil hue aur halki do rak'at padhein. Ek aadmi ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Yaqzan! Main ne unhein yaad kar liya hai. Unhon ne jawab diya: Kya tum ne dekha ke main ne un ki muqarrar hadon mein se kuch chhoda? Balke mukhtasar kein; bhoolne ke darr se jaldi kein. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Aadmi zaroor namaz padhta hai; shayed us ki namaz mein se daswaan, nawaan, aathwaan, saatwaan ya paanchwaan hissa hi us ke liye likha jaata hai.'"
"77","[AI-translation] Ma'dan bin Abi Talha Al-Ya'muri ne kaha: Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha: Tumhari rihaish kahaan hai? Main ne kaha: Hims se pehle gaon mein. Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jab bhi teen aadmi gaon ya jangal mein rahein aur un mein namaz qayam na ho — to shaitan zaroor un par ghalib aata hai. Jama'at ko pakdo; bhediya door hui bakri hi khaata hai.' Sa'ib [bin Hubaysh] ne kaha: Jama'at se murad namaz ki jama'at hai."
"78","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Jo jhoot aur us ke mutabiq amal aur jahalat na chhode — us ke khana-peena chhodne ki Allah ko koi haajat nahin.'"
"79","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bahut rozedar — roze se bhookh ke siwa kuch nahin paate; bahut [raat mein] khade hone wale — khade hone se bedari ke siwa kuch nahin paate.'"
"80","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ki raah mein do jode [kuch] kharch kare, use jannat ke darwazon se pukara jayega: Ae Allah ke bande! Yeh behtar hai. Namaziyon mein se hua to namaz ke darwaze se pukara jayega; zakat dene walon mein se hua to zakat ke darwaze se; jihad karne walon mein se hua to jihad ke darwaze se; rozedaron mein se hua to Rayyan [khoob peene ke] darwaze se pukara jayega.' Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Mere maan-baap Aap par qurban — kya kisi ko sab darwazon se pukarne ki zaroorat hai — lekin kya koi hai jise sab darwazon se pukara jayega? Farmaya: Haan; ummeed hai tum un mein hoge."
"81","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ko sab se mehboob aamal — jo pabandi se kiye jayein, chaahe thode hon.' Aur jab bhi Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) koi amal kartin to pabandi se pakadtin."
"82","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Khushkhabri us ke liye jis ki umr lambi aur aamal achhe hon.'"
"83","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ubaid bin Khalid As-Salmi (Raziyallahu anhu) — woh Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba [Raziyallahu anhum] mein se hain — se riwayat hai: [Nabi Alaihissalam] ne do aadmiyon ke darmiyan bhai-chara karaya. Ek shaheed hua, doosra baad mein mara. Hum ne us ki namaz-e-janaza padhi; Nabi-e-Kareem [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Tum ne kya kaha?' Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne us ke liye dua ki: Ae Allah! Us par reham kar; Ae Allah! Use us ke saathi se mila de! To Nabi-e-Kareem [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'To us ke saathi ki namaz ke baad us ki namaz kahaan gayi? Aur us ke aamal kahaan gaye?' Aur mera khayal hai Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Us ke saathi ke roze ke baad us ka roza kahaan gaya? Donon ke darmiyan faasla aasman-zameen ke faasle jaisa hai.' Amr bin Maimun ne kaha: Mujhe yeh hadees pasand hai — kyunke unhon ne mujhe sanad ke saath sunayi hai."
"84","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Saat aadmi — qiyamat ke din Allah unhein apne [arsh ke] saaye mein saaya dega — jis din us ke saaye ke siwa koi saaya nahin hoga: aadil hakim; Allah ki ibadat mein pala-badha naujawan; tanhayi mein Allah ko yaad karke aankhein aansuon se bhar jaane wala aadmi; masjid se latke dil wala aadmi; Allah ke liye aapas mein muhabbat karne wale do aadmi; martaba-khoobsurti wali aurat bulaye to Main Allah se darta hoon kehne wala aadmi; aur sadqa dekar itna chhupane wala aadmi — ke baayan haath na jaane daayan haath ne kya diya.'"
"85","[AI-translation] Sha'bi [Rahimahullah] ne kaha: Main ne Sayyiduna Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko mimbar se kehte suna: 'Apne bewaqoofon ko roko; main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Kuch log samandar mein jahaz par sawar hue; aapas mein hisse baante; har aadmi apni jagah pohncha. Un mein se ek ne kulhadi li aur apni jagah chhed karne laga. Unhon ne kaha: Kya kar rahe ho? Us ne jawab diya: Yeh meri jagah hai; jaisa chahoon karoon ga. Haath rok liye to woh bachenge, woh bhi bachega; chhod diya to woh doobega, woh bhi doobenge. Is liye halakat se pehle apne bewaqoofon ko roko.'"
"86","[AI-translation] Adi bin Adi Al-Kindi bayan karte hain: Hamare ek aazad-karda ne hamein bataya: Main ne apne dada ko kehte suna — main ne Rasulullah [Alaihissalam] ko farmate suna: 'Beshak Allah aam logon ko khaas logon ke [bure kaamon] ki wajah se azab nahin deta — jab tak woh apne darmiyan burayi dekhein, rokne ki taqat rakhein, lekin na rokein. Aisa karein to Allah khaas logon ki wajah se aam logon ko azab deta hai.'"
"87","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein dakhil hue aur do majlisein dekhein. Ek jama'at Allah se dua kar rahi thi, shauq se us ki taraf mutawajjah thi; aur doosri deen seekh rahi thi, samajh rahi thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Donon majlisein khair par hain; lekin ek doosri se afzal hai. Rahe yeh log, yeh Allah se dua kar rahe hain, us ki taraf mutawajjah hain; chahe to dega, chahe to nahin dega. Lekin yeh log seekh rahe hain, jahilon ko sikha rahe hain; aur main to mu'allim bana kar hi bheja gaya hoon — is liye yeh log afzal hain.' Phir Aap [Alaihissalam] un ke saath baith gaye."
"88","[AI-translation] Alqamah bin Waqqas bayan karte hain: Sayyiduna Bilal bin Haris Al-Muzani (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: Main tumhein in hukmaranon ke paas jaate aur unhein dhaankte dekhta hoon; dekho kya lekar un ke saamne jaate ho. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Aadmi zaroor achhi baat kehta hai — jis ka anjaam nahin samajhta; is ki wajah se Allah us ke liye us se mulaqat ke din tak apni raza likh deta hai. Aur aadmi zaroor buri baat kehta hai — jis ka anjaam nahin samajhta; is ki wajah se Allah us ke liye us se mulaqat ke din tak apni narazgi likh deta hai.' Alqamah kehte the: Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) se suni bahut-si hadees mere aur un ke darmiyan rukawat bani."
"89","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Umm Ammarah bint Ka'b (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere ghar aaye; main ne Aap ke saamne khana rakha. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne mujh se kaha: 'Khao.' Main ne kaha: Main roze se hoon. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Rozedar ke saamne khana khaya jaaye to farishte zaroor us ke liye rehmat-bakhshish ki dua karte hain — un ke farigh hone tak.' Ya farmaya: 'Un ke khana khatm karne tak.'"
"90","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Tum mein se koi Allah ki nemat ki qadr pehchanna chahe to neeche wale ki taraf dekhe, oopar wale ki taraf na dekhe.'"
"91","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koi apne aamal ki wajah se jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga.' Unhon ne kaha: Aap bhi nahin — ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)? Farmaya: 'Main bhi nahin — jab tak Allah mujhe apni rehmat mein na dhaanp le ya us ki bakhshish mujhe na gher le.'"
"92","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Huzaifah bin Yaman (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek bhikari khada hua aur [madad] maangne laga. Log khamosh rahe. Phir ek aadmi ne use kuch diya; logon ne bhi diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo achha tareeqa jaari kare, phir us par chala jaaye — us ke liye is ka ajr aur chalne walon ka ajr — un ke ajr mein zara bhi kami kiye baghair. Aur jo bura tareeqa jaari kare, us par chala jaaye — us par is ka bojh aur chalne walon ka bojh — un ke bojh mein zara bhi kami kiye baghair.'"
"93","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Main tum mein kuch nahin pehchanta — jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein pehchanta tha — tumhare 'La ilaha illallah' kehne ke siwa. Hum ne kaha: Namaz bhi nahin — ae Abu Hamzah!? Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne sooraj doobne ke baad [Asr ki] namaz padhi hai; kya yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz thi? Phir kaha: Is ke bawajood amal karne wale ke liye tumhare is zamane se behtar koi zamana nahin dekha."
"94","[AI-translation] Sayyidina Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Jab Sayyidah Zainab [bint Jahsh] (Raziyallahu anha) ki iddat poori hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zaid [bin Harisah] (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: 'Jaao, unhein mera nikah ka paigham do.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Gaya; kaha: Ae Zainab (Raziyallahu anha)! Khushkhabri lo; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe bheja hai; woh tum se nikah ka paigham de rahe hain.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Apne Aziz o Jaleel Rabb se mashwara kiye baghair kuch nahin karoon gi.' Woh apni namaz ki jagah ki taraf khadi huein; Quran nazil hua; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaye — yahan tak ke baghair ijazat un ke paas aaye."
"95","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main aur qiyamat in donon ki tarah bheje gaye hain.' Aur jab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qiyamat ka zikr karte to rukhsar surkh hote, aawaz buland hoti, ghussa shadeed hota — goya lashkar se dara rahe hain: 'Subah tum par hamla kar sakta hai, shaam tum par chhapa maar sakta hai.'"
"96","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne din mein hamein Asr ki namaz padhayi, phir sooraj doobne tak khutba diya. Qiyamat tak jo hone wala hai, kuch nahin chhoda — hamein samjha diya. Jis ne yaad rakha, yaad rakha; jis ne bhulaya, bhulaya. Aur jab sooraj doobne laga to Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Aur tumhari duniya ka jo guzar gaya aur jo baqi hai — woh tumhare is din jaisa hai: us ka jo guzar gaya aur us ka jo baqi hai.'"
"97","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Qiyamat zaroor do aadmiyon par qayam hogi — un ke kapde haathon mein hone ki haalat mein."
"98","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main kaise khush o mutma'in rahoon — soor wala [farishta] soor munh mein liye dhyan se sun raha hai — phoonkne ke hukm ka intezar kar raha hai — phoonkega.' Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba par yeh giraan guzra; to us waqt Aap [Alaihissalam] ne un se kaha: 'Kaho: Hamein Allah kaafi hai aur woh behtareen karsaz hai; Allah hi par hum ne bharosa kiya.'"
"99","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur poocha: 'Soor kya hai?' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Seeng hai — jis mein phoonka jayega.'"
"100","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qiyamat ke din Allah zameen ko mutthi mein pakdega, phir aasmanon ko daayein haath mein lapetega; farmayega: Main hi akela Badshah hoon; zameen ke badshah kahaan hain?'"
"101","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh aayat tilawat ki: [Us din woh [zameen] apni khabrein bayan karegi — Surah Zilzal 4]. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne poocha: 'Is ki khabrein kya hain, jaante ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] behtar jaante hain. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Is ki khabrein yeh hain ke woh har bande-bandi ke baare mein gawahi degi jo unhon ne us ki peeth par kiya. Kahegi: Falan din us ne falan kaam kiya. Yahi is ki khabrein hain.'"
"102","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: [Jis din log jahanon ke Rabb ke saamne khade honge — Surah Mutaffifin 6] — [matlab] koi apne paseene mein kaanon ke aadhe tak dooba hoga."
"103","[AI-translation] Pichhli hadees jaisi."
"104","[AI-translation] Rasulullah ke sahabi Sayyiduna Miqdad (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jab qiyamat aayegi to sooraj bandon ke qareeb laya jayega — ek ya do meel door.' Salim [rawi] kehte hain: Nahin jaanta do meel mein se kaun-sa — zameen ka faasla ya surma-salayi [jis se aankh mein surma lagaya jaata hai]. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Sooraj unhein pighlayega; aur woh aamal ke mutabiq paseene mein honge. Un mein koi hoga jise paseena takhnon tak pakdega, koi jise ghutnon tak pakdega, koi jise kamar tak pakdega; aur koi hoga jise lagam pehnayi jayegi.' Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha — woh haath se munh ki taraf ishara karke farma rahe the: 'Use lagam pehnayi jayegi.'"
"105","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Roza aur Quran bande ke liye sifarish karenge. Roza kahega: Ae Rabb! Main ne din mein use khane-khwahishon se roka; us ke baare mein meri sifarish qabool kar. Aur Quran kahega: Ae Rabb! Main ne raat mein use neend se roka; us ke baare mein meri sifarish qabool kar. Is tarah donon sifarishein qabool hongi.'"
"106","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Masood (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Logon mein pehla faisla khoon ke [qatl ke] mu'amlat mein hoga.'"
"107","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qiyamat ke din banda laya jayega — goya chhoti bakri — Allah ke saamne khada kiya jayega. Allah farmayega: Main ne diya, ata kiya, in'aam kiya; kya kiya? Woh kahega: Ae Rabb! Jama kiya, badhaya, jo tha us se zyada peeche chhod aaya [maal mein se], lauta de, sab tere paas laoon ga. Allah us se kahega: Jo aage bheja, dikha. Woh kahega: Jama kiya, badhaya, jo tha us se zyada peeche chhod aaya; lauta de, sab tere paas laoon ga. Achanak woh banda koi nek amal aage nahin bhejega; jahannam ki taraf haanka jayega.'"
"108","[AI-translation] Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jis ka tafseeli hisab liya jayega, woh halak hoga.' Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Allah Ta'ala to farmata hai: [Jise daayein haath mein kitab di jayegi, jald us ka aasan hisab liya jayega — Surah Inshiqaq 7-8]. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Woh sirf peshi hogi.'"
"109","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aziz o Jaleel Allah qiyamat ke din tamam makhlooq ke saamne meri ummat ke ek shakhs ko chunega. Us ke saamne ninyanwe daftar khole jayenge — har daftar nigah jahaan tak jaaye. Phir us se kahega: Is se kuch inkar karte ho? Mere likhne wale farishton ne tum par zulm kiya? Woh kahega: Nahin, ae Rabb! Allah kahega: Tumhare paas koi uzr ya nek amal hai? Aadmi ghabrahat se choor hokar kahega: Nahin, ae Rabb! Allah kahega: Balke hamare paas tumhari ek neki hai; aaj tum par zulm nahin hoga. Phir us ke liye ek parcha nikala jayega — us mein likha hoga: Main gawahi deta hoon ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, Muhammad [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] us ke bande aur Rasul hain. Allah kahega: Tarazu par aao. Aadmi kahega: Ae Rabb! In daftaron ke muqable is parche ki kya qeemat? Allah kahega: Tum par zulm nahin hoga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir tarazu ke ek palde mein sab daftar rakhe jayenge — aur daftar halke honge, parcha bhaari hoga; Allah ke naam se bhaari kuch nahin.'"
"110","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gosht laya gaya; us ki agli raan Aap ki taraf uthayi gayi; Aap use pasand karte the. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne daanton se nocha, phir farmaya: 'Qiyamat ke din main logon ka sardar hoon ga. Jaante ho woh kaise hoga? Allah agle-pichhle sab logon ko ek maidan mein jama karega. Pukarne wala sunayega, nigah gheregi, sooraj qareeb aayega. Log aise gham-takleef ko pohnchenge — na utha sakenge na seh sakenge. Log ek-doosre se kahenge: Aadam [Alaihissalam] ke paas jaao. Woh Aadam [Alaihissalam] ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Aap bani-Aadam ke baap hain; Allah ne apne haath se paida kiya, Aap mein apni rooh phoonki, farishton ko hukm diya — unhon ne sajda kiya. Apne Rabb ke paas hamari sifarish karein. Hamari haalat nahin dekhte? Hum par jo aaya nahin dekhte? Aadam [Alaihissalam] un se kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai — pehle kabhi aisa nahin hua, is ke baad bhi kabhi aisa nahin hoga. Us ne mujhe us darakht se mana kiya tha; main ne nafarmani ki. Haaye mera nafs, haaye mera nafs! Doosre ke paas jaao — Nooh [Alaihissalam] ke paas jaao. Woh Nooh [Alaihissalam] ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Nooh! Aap zameen walon ki taraf bheje gaye pehle Rasul hain; Allah ne Aap ko shukrguzar banda naam diya. Apne Rabb ke paas hamari sifarish karein. Hamari haalat nahin dekhte? Hum par jo aaya nahin dekhte? Woh kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai — pehle kabhi aisa nahin hua, is ke baad bhi kabhi aisa nahin hoga. Meri ek dua thi; qaum ke khilaf istemal ki. Haaye mera nafs, haaye mera nafs! Doosre ke paas jaao — Ibrahim [Alaihissalam] ke paas jaao. Woh Ibrahim [Alaihissalam] ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Ibrahim! Aap zameen walon mein Allah ke Nabi o dost hain. Apne Rabb ke paas hamari sifarish karein. Hamari haalat nahin dekhte? Woh un se kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai — pehle kabhi aisa nahin hua, is ke baad bhi kabhi aisa nahin hoga. Main ne teen jhooti baatein kahi thein. Abu Hayyan [rawi] ne hadees mein un ka zikr kiya. Haaye mera nafs, haaye mera nafs! Doosre ke paas jaao — Musa [Alaihissalam] ke paas jaao. Woh Musa [Alaihissalam] ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Musa! Aap Allah ke Rasul hain. Us ne apne paighamat o kalam se logon par Aap ko fazeelat di. Apne Rabb ke paas hamari sifarish karein. Hamari haalat nahin dekhte? Woh kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai — pehle kabhi aisa nahin hua, is ke baad bhi kabhi aisa nahin hoga. Main ne ek jaan maari — jis ke maarne ka hukm nahin paya tha. Haaye mera nafs, haaye mera nafs! Doosre ke paas jaao — Isa [Alaihissalam] ke paas jaao. Woh Isa [Alaihissalam] ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Isa! Aap Allah ke Rasul o us ke kalime hain — jo Maryam [Alaihassalam] ki taraf daala — us ki taraf se rooh; god mein logon se baat ki. Apne Rabb ke paas hamari sifarish karein. Hamari haalat nahin dekhte? Isa [Alaihissalam] kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai — pehle kabhi aisa nahin hua, is ke baad bhi kabhi aisa nahin hoga. Koi gunah zikr nahin karenge. Haaye mera nafs, haaye mera nafs! Doosre ke paas jaao — Muhammad — Allah ke Rasul [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ke paas jaao. Woh Muhammad [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Muhammad! Aap Allah ke Rasul o Nabiyon ke Khatim hain. Allah ne Aap ke agle-pichhle gunah bakhsh diye. Apne Rabb ke paas hamari sifarish karein. Hamari haalat nahin dekhte? Main jaaoon ga aur Arsh ke neeche aaoon ga, apne Rabb ko sajda karoon ga. Allah mere liye apni hamd o khoobsurat kalimat kholega — mujh se pehle kisi ke liye jo nahin khole. Kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad! Sir uthao; maango, diya jayega; sifarish karo, qabool hogi. Sir utha kar kahoon ga: Meri ummat, ae Rabb! Meri ummat, ae Rabb! Meri ummat, ae Rabb! Muhammad [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] se kaha jayega: Apni ummat mein se jin ka hisab nahin — jannat ke daayein darwaze se dakhil karo; is ke siwa doosre darwazon mein logon ke saath shareek honge. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Jannat ke darwaze ke do pallon ka faasla Makkah-Hajar ya Makkah-Busra ke faasle jaisa hai.'"
"111","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Uqbah bin Aamir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh hadees zikr karke farmaya: 'Isa [Alaihissalam] kahenge: Kya main tumhein Ummi Nabi ka raasta na bataoon? Woh mere paas aayenge; Allah mujhe khade hone ki ijazat dega; meri majlis lautegi — pakeezatarin khushbu ke saath jo kisi ne kabhi nahin soonghi — apne Rabb ke paas aane tak; woh meri sifarish qabool karega; sir ke baal se pair ke nakhun tak mere liye noor banayega. Tab kafir kahenge: Mominon ko sifarishi mil gaya; hamare liye kaun sifarish karega? Woh kahenge: Iblees ke siwa koi nahin — us ne hamein gumrah kiya. Woh us ke paas aayenge; woh khada hoga; us ki majlis lautegi — badtarin badbu ke saath jo kisi ne kabhi nahin soonghi; phir unhein jahannam le jayega; tab woh kahega: Aur jab mu'amla [jannat-jahannam] tay ho jayega to shaitan kahega: Allah ne tum se sachcha wada kiya tha; main ne wada kiya, khilaf kiya.'"
"112","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Zarr o Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qiyamat ke din sajde ki ijazat sab se pehle mujhe di jayegi; sir uthane ki ijazat bhi sab se pehle mujhe di jayegi. Saamne dekh kar ummaton mein apni ummat pehchanoon ga; daayein dekh kar ummaton mein apni ummat pehchanoon ga; baayein dekh kar ummaton mein apni ummat pehchanoon ga; peeche dekh kar ummaton mein apni ummat pehchanoon ga.' Ek aadmi ne poocha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Nooh [Alaihissalam] se apni ummat tak ummaton mein apni ummat kaise pehchanenge? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Un ke chehre-haath-pair wuzu ke nishan se roshan honge; ummaton mein kisi aur ke paas yeh nahin hoga; main unhein pehchanoon ga. Un ke aamal-naame daayein haath mein diye jayenge; chehron par sajde ke nishan se peshaniyan dekh kar pehchanoon ga; saamne o daayein chalne wale noor se pehchanoon ga.'"
"113","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Qiyamat ke din meri ummat raat ki tarah ya sailab ki tarah aayegi — ek saath logon ko bahati. Farishte kahenge: Muhammad [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ke saath jo aaye, woh baqi ummaton ke saath jo aaye, un se zyada hain.'"
"114","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har Nabi ke liye qabool dua hai; us ne woh kar li; main ne apni dua qiyamat ke din ummat ki sifarish ke liye chhupa rakhi hai.'"
"115","[AI-translation] Buhz bin Hakeem pita se, woh dada se bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah [Alaihissalam] ko farmate suna: 'Qiyamat ke din tum sattar ummatein poori karoge; Aziz o Jaleel Allah ke nazdeek tum un mein sab se behtar o sab se mu'azzaz hoge.'"
"116","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hum baad mein aane wale, lekin qiyamat ke din sab se aage; kyunke Ahle-Kitab ko yeh [Juma] hum se pehle diya gaya, hamein un ke baad diya gaya. Yeh un ka din hai — jis mein unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya; Allah ne hamein raah dikhayi; is mein woh hamare peeche chalte hain. Yahoodiyon ka agla din [Sanichar], Isaiyon ka us ke baad wala din [Itwar] hai.'"
"117","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Barzah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Unhon ne Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Meri ummat mein kuch hain jo aag ki tazeem karenge — yahan tak ke us ke sutun ban jayenge; meri ummat mein aise bhi hain jo Rabi'ah-Mudar [qabeelon] se zyada logon ki sifarish karenge.'"
"118","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Meri ummat ka ek giroh — tadad sattar hazaar — jannat mein dakhil hoga; un ke chehre chaudahvin raat ke chaand ki roshni jaise roshan honge.' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Ukashah bin Mihsan (Raziyallahu anhu) khade hue, oopar ki dhaaridar chaadar uthayi; kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Allah se dua karein, mujhe un mein kare. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ae Allah! Unhein un mein kar.' Phir Ansar ka ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Mere liye dua karein, Allah mujhe un mein kare. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is mein Ukashah [Raziyallahu anhu] tum se aage badh gaya.'"
"119","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Fadalah bin Ubaid o Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab qiyamat aayegi aur Allah makhlooq ka faisla khatm karega to do aadmi baqi rahenge. Jahannam ki taraf le jaane ka hukm hoga; ek palat kar peeche dekhega. Jabbar [Allah] kahega: Lautao. Lautaya jayega; kaha jayega: Peeche kyun dekha? Woh kahega: Ummeed thi woh mujhe jannat mein dakhil karega.' Farmaya: 'Jannat ki taraf le jaane ka hukm hoga.' Farmaya: 'Woh kahega: Mere Rabb ne mujhe [itna] diya — jannat walon sab ko khilaoon to jo hai [khilane ko] zara bhi na ghate.' Jab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is ka zikr karte to chehre par khushi dekhi jaati."
"120","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jahannam mein dakhil kiye gaye logon mein do aadmiyon ka cheekhna-rona bahut shadeed hua. Aziz o Jaleel Allah ne kaha: In donon ko nikalo. Donon nikale gaye to kaha jayega: Tumhara cheekhna-rona itna shadeed kyun hua? Donon ne kaha: Hum ne yeh is liye kiya ke Aap hum par reham karein. Farmaya: Tumhare liye meri rehmat — donon jaao, jahaan the wahan jahannam mein kood jaao. Donon jayenge; ek jahannam mein koodega; Allah us ke liye thandak o salamti banayega; doosra khada rahega, nahin koodega. Rabb poochega: Saathi jaisa koodne se kis ne roka? Woh kahega: Ae Rabb! Ummeed thi nikalne ke baad phir nahin lautaega. Rabb us se kahega: Tere liye teri ummeed. Donon us ki rehmat se jannat mein dakhil honge.'"
"121","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri [Sa'd bin Malik bin Sinan] (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Aziz Allah jannat walon se kahega: Ae jannat walo! Woh kahenge: Ae Rabb! Baar-baar hazir. Kahega: Raazi hue? Woh kahenge: Kyun na raazi hon — toone hamein woh diya jo makhlooq mein kisi ko nahin diya. Kahega: Is se behtar doon ga. Woh kahenge: Ae Rabb! Is se behtar kya? Kahega: Tumhare liye apni raza halal ki; is ke baad kabhi tum se naraz nahin hoon ga.'"
"122","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jannat mein dakhil hone wala pehla giroh — chehre poornima ke chaand jaise honge. Us mein na thookega, na naak jhadega, na pakhana-peshab karenge. Bartan sone ke, kanghe sone-chaandi ke, dhoopdan ood lakdi ke honge. Paseena mushk hoga; har ek ki do biwiyan — khoobsurti se gosht ke peeche se pindli ka maghz dikhega. Un mein ikhtilaf ya bughz nahin hoga; dil ek dil jaise; subah-shaam Allah ki tasbeeh padhenge.'"
"123","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hum baad mein aane wale, lekin qiyamat ke din sab se aage. Meri ummat ka jannat mein dakhil hone wala pehla giroh sattar hazaar — baghair hisab. Har ek ka chehra chaudahvin raat ke poornima jaise. Phir peeche aane wale aasman ke raushantarin sitare jaise. Phir kayi darje.'"
"124","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Chhote nakhun se bhi kam jannat ki [nemat] zahir ho to aasman-zameen ke ird-gird sajawat se bhar jaaye. Jannat walon mein se koi jhaanke, us ke kangan nazar aayein — to un ka noor sooraj ki roshni ko maat de — jaise sooraj taron ki roshni bujha deta hai.'"
"125","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Jannat wale oonche kamron se fazeelat ke darjon mein ek-doosre ko dekhenge — jaise tum mashriq-maghrib ke tare dekhte ho — ufuq mein doobte ya tulu hote.' Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Kya woh sirf Nabi honge? Farmaya: Kyun nahin! Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Aur woh bhi — jo Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] par iman laye, Rasoolon ki tasdeeq ki."
"126","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jannat walon mein adna — assi khadim, bahattar biwiyan payega. Us ke liye moti-zamurrad-yaqoot ka khema lagaya jayega — Jabiyah-Sana'a ke faasle jaisa bada.'"
"127","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se [bayan hua ke] Nabi Muhammad [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Jannat walon mein se jo mare — jawan ya boodha — jannat mein tees saal ki umr mein lautaya jayega; is se bada kabhi nahin hoga. Jahannami bhi usi umr ke honge.'"
"128","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Apna chehra us ke [hoor ke] gaal mein aaine se zyada wazeh dekhega; us ke jism ka adna moti mashriq-maghrib ke darmiyan raushan karega; haqeeqat mein us par sattar libas honge — nigah un mein se guzregi — peeche se pindli ka maghz dekhne tak.'"
"129","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Jannat mein aisa bada darakht — sawar saaye mein sattar — ya kaha, sau — saal chale; yeh hamesha rehne ka darakht hai.'"
"130","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Aziz o Jaleel Allah ne farmaya: Apne nek bandon ke liye tayyar kiya — jo na aankh ne dekha, na kaan ne suna, na insan ke dil mein kabhi aaya.'"
"131","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab jannat wale jannat ki taraf, jahannami jahannam ki taraf chalenge to maut layi jayegi — jannat-jahannam ke darmiyan rakhi jayegi — zibah ki jayegi. Munadi pukarega: Ae jannat walo! [Ab] maut nahin; ae jahannam walo! [Ab] maut nahin. Jannat wale khushi mein khushi badhayenge; jahannami gham mein gham badhayenge.'"
"132","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne marfu bayan kiya: 'Qiyamat ke din maut chitkabre mendhe ki shakl mein layi jayegi; jannat-jahannam ke darmiyan khadi ki jayegi. Kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo! Yeh maut hai. Ae jahannam walo! Yeh maut hai. Phir un ke dekhte-dekhte zibah ki jayegi.' Khushi se koi marta to jannat wale marte; gham se koi marta to jahannami marte."
"133","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar aisa patthar' — Aap [Alaihissalam] ne khopdi ki taraf ishara kiya — 'aasman se zameen par phenka jaaye — aur woh paanch sau saal ka faasla hai — to shaam se pehle pohnchta. Aur agar us zanjeer ke sire se chhoda jaaye to chalees saal girta rehta — din-raat — pohnchne [jahannam ki teh mein] se pehle.'"
"134","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Ae logo! Roo; na roo to rone ki soorat banao. Jahannami jahannam mein royenge — aansu chehron par sinchayi ki naliyon jaise bahenge — aansu khatm hon to khoon bahega. Aankhein zakhmi hongi; un mein kashtiyan chalayi jayein to zaroor chalein.'"
"135","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: [Woh us mein munh bigade honge — Surah Mu'minun 104]. Farmaya: Aag use jalayegi; oopar ka honth sikudkar sir ke beech pohnchega; neeche ka honth latakkar naaf tak pohnchega."
"136","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhari yeh aag — jo Aadam ki aulad jalati hai — jahannam ki [aag ke] sattar hisson mein se ek hissa hai.' Unhon ne [sahaba Raziyallahu anhum] kaha: Allah ki qasam! Yahi [duniya ki aag] kaafi hoti. Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Farmaya: 'Beshak is ke siwa unhattar hisse badhaye gaye hain — sab is ki garmi jaise.'"
"137","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Siron par zaroor khaulta paani daala jayega; khopdi mein ghus kar pet tak pohnchega; pet mein jo hai nikal dega — pairon se nikalne tak; yahi pighalna hai. Phir jaisa tha lautaya jayega.'"
"138","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Aziz Allah ke farman ke baare mein bayan karte hain: [Use peep ka paani pilaya jayega, mushkil se ghoont bharega — Surah Ibrahim 17]. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: Qareeb laya jaaye to bahut nagawar lagega; qareeb laane par chehra jalayega, sir ki khaal gir padegi. Peeyega to aantein kaat kar peeth se niklega. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farma rahe the: [Unhein khaulta paani pilaya jayega, un ki aantein kaat dega — Surah Muhammad 15]. Aziz Allah ne farmaya: [Madad maangein to pighle taambe jaise paani se madad ki jayegi — chehre jalayega; bura sharbat, buri aaramgah — Surah Kahf 29]."
"139","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh paani pighle taambe jaisa — tel ki talchhat jaisa hoga; qareeb laane par chehre ki khaal gir padegi.'"
"140","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se bayan hua: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jahannam ki chaardeewari chaar moti deewarein hain; har deewar chalees saal ka faasla hai.'"
"141","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se bayan hua: Nabi Muhammad [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Peep ki ek baalti duniya mein undeli jaaye to duniya walon ko zaroor badbudar kar de.'"
"142","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis raat mujhe Shab-e-Meraj karayi gayi, kuch log dekhe — aag ki qainchiyon se honth kaate ja rahe the. Poocha: Ae Jibreel [Alaihissalam]! Yeh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh tumhari ummat ke khateeb hain — jo logon ko neki ka hukm dete the, khud ko bhoolte the; kitab ki tilawat karte the. To kya nahin samajhte?'"
"143","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jahannam mein ek waadi hai — Lamlam naam ki. Jahannam ki waadiyan us ki garmi se panah maangti hain.'"
"144","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Wail jahannam ki waadi hai; kafir us mein chalees saal girta rahega — gehrayi tak pohnchne se pehle; Sa'ood aag ka pahad hai; sattar saal chadhta rahega — phir aag mein girega.'"
"145","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Ek Yahoodi ne ladki ka sir do pattharon ke darmiyan kuchal diya. Us se poocha gaya: Tumhare saath yeh kis ne kiya? Kaha gaya: Falan ya falan? Us Yahoodi ka naam aane tak — us ne sir se ishara kiya — matlab haan. Yahoodi ko bulaya gaya; jurm qabool kiya. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne us ke baare mein hukm diya; us ka sir bhi do pattharon ke darmiyan — ya kaha, patthar se — kuchal diya gaya."
"146","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ungliyon ke liye — har ek mein das [oont] [khoonbaha]; haddi zahir karne wale zakhm ke liye — paanch [oont] [khoonbaha].'"
"147","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Yeh aur yeh barabar hain' — Shobah [rawi] ne chhoti ungli o angoothe ki taraf ishara kiya."
"148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ungliyan barabar hain.' Main ne Ghalib Tammar se kaha: 'Har ungli mein das oont harjana?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Haan.'"
"149","[AI-translation] Haram bin Sa'd bin Muhayshah o Sa'id bin Musayyib [Rahimahumullah] bayan karte hain: Bara bin Aazib (Raziyallahu anhu) ki oontni logon ke baagh mein ghusi aur nuqsan kiya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla diya: 'Din mein maal ki hifazat malikon par hai; chaupayon ke malikon par [harjana] hai — raat mein un ke janwar jo karein.'"
"150","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Mughirah bin Shobah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Banu Huzail ke ek aadmi ke tehat [biwi ke taur par] do auratein thein; ek ne kheme ke dande se doosri ko maara — hamal gir gaya. Nabi Muhammad [Alaihissalam] ke paas jhagda laaye; kaha: Jo na roya, na cheekha, na piya, na khaya — us ka khoonbaha kaise dein? Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Dehatiyon ke muqaffa kalam jaisa muqaffa kalam?' Phir Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne ghulam aazad karne ka faisla diya; aurat ke asbah [mard rishtedaron] par lazim kiya."
"151","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ya'la bin Munabbih ne kaatne wale shakhs — daant toota — ke baare mein zikr kiya — us ke liye harjana [diyat] nahin. Nabi Muhammad [Alaihissalam] ke saamne muamla zikr kiya; Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Tumhare liye harjana nahin.'"
"152","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se wahi hadees bayan hui — Ibne Ya'la walid se bayan karte hain."
"153","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek aadmi laya gaya — jis ne sharab pi thi. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne do dandon se qareeb chalees baar maara. Unhon ne kaha, aur yahi Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kiya. Phir jab Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) [Khaleefah] hue to logon se mashwara kiya. Abdurrahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Hudood mein halki muqarrar saza assi kode hain; Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne is baare mein hukm diya."
"154","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sharabi laya gaya. Us ne kaha: Sharab nahin pi; kaddu ke bartan mein kishmish-khajoor [sharab] pi hai. Haathon-jooton se daanta gaya; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaddu ke bartan aur kishmish-khajoor milana [peene ke liye] mana kiya."
"155","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Umayyah Makhzoomi (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chor laya gaya — us ne iqrar kiya; maal nahin mila. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se kaha: 'Nahin samajhta ke tum ne chori ki.' Us ne kaha: Kyun nahin. Aap [Nabi] ne phir kaha: 'Nahin samajhta ke tum ne chori ki.' Us ne kaha: Kyun nahin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha: 'Le jaao, haath kaato; mere paas lautao.' Haath kaat kar lautaya gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha: 'Kaho: Allah se bakhshish maangta hoon, us ki taraf tauba karta hoon.' Us ne kaha: Allah se bakhshish maangta hoon, us ki taraf tauba karta hoon. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha: 'Ae Allah! Us ki tauba qabool kar.'"
"156","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Muhairiz ne kaha: Fadalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se chor ka haath gale mein latkane ke baare mein poocha; unhon ne kaha: Yeh sunnat hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chor ka haath kaat kar gale mein latkaya."
"157","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Khet mein bakriyon ke baadon ke baare mein kya raay hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Un ke liye unhi jaisa harjana hai; saza ke taur par kode hain; chaupayon mein kisi cheez ke liye haath nahin kaata jaata — siwa us ke jise baada samoye, aur dhaal ki qeemat ko pohnche — to us ke liye haath kaata jaata hai. Aur phalon mein kisi cheez ke liye [haath nahin kaata jaata] — siwa us ke jise khalihan [jahaan phal jama hote hain] samoye. Jo khalihan se le aur dhaal ki qeemat ko pohnche to us ke liye haath kaata jaaye.'"
"158","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne daaku, chheenne wale o khiyanat karne wale se haath kaatna maaf kiya hai."
"159","[AI-translation] Nabi Muhammad [Alaihissalam] ki paak biwi Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Qada' naami jagah ka ek aadmi — jis par Makkah walon ne chori ka ilzam lagaya tha — Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke khilafat mein un ke paas aaya. Unhon ne us se narmi dikhayi — yahan tak ke Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Ansar mein se ek zakat wasool karne wala bheja, us aadmi ke saath bheja; qareeb do mahine narmi dikhate rahe. Phir woh lauta; oont bithaya ja raha tha. Zakat wasool karne wale ne pehle hi us ka haath kaat diya tha. [Ayesha Raziyallahu anha kehtin hain:] Jab Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use dekha to aankhein aansuon se bhar gayein; kaha: 'Afsos tum par, kya hua?' Us ne kaha: 'Ae Abu Bakr [Raziyallahu anhu]! Us ne mujhe farz [zakat] ke paas paya; is mein mera haath kaata.' Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Tumhara haath kaatne wale ko Allah halak kare — is farz mein, jise us ne pehlu mein rakha tha. Allah ki qasam! Use tees se zyada faraiz mein khiyanat karte dekhta hoon. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar sach mein sachche ho to us se tumhara badla zaroor loon ga.' Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) kehtin hain: Haath katne se pehle jahaan thi — Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke ghar usi kamre mein thi. Woh [chor] raat mein khada hokar namaz padhta; Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) bistar par bechain hote; tilawat sunte to aankhein aansuon se bhar jaatin; kehte: 'Us ka haath kaatne wale ka haath Allah kaate.' Isi haal mein Asma binte Umais (Raziyallahu anha) — Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ki biwi — raat mein aayein; un ke ghar mein chori hui thi. Jab Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Fajr padhayi to logon mein khade hokar kaha: 'Qabe ele ke log raat mein aaye; chori ho gayi. Niklo aur un ka maal talash karo.' Kehtin hain: Us kate-haath wale ne hamare paas dakhile ki ijazat maangi; Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne ijazat di; main parde ke peeche baithi thi. Us ne kaha: 'Ae Abu Bakr! Kya raat mein koi pehredar na tha?' Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne jawab diya: 'Haan.' Us ne salamat haath o kata haath uthaya aur kaha: 'Ae Allah! Abu Bakr [Raziyallahu anhu] ke chor ko ruswa kar.' Kehtin hain: Allah ki qasam! Din poori tarah tulu hone se pehle usi ghar se chori pakdi gayi. Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas laya gaya; unhon ne kaha: 'Afsos tum par! Allah ki qasam! Allah ke baare mein kuch nahin jaante. Le jaao, pair kaato.'"
"160","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai — woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kartin hain ke Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Chor ka haath chauthayi deenar mein kaata jaaye.'"
"161","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se yeh hadees bayan hui."
"162","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai — woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain ke Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Dhaal ke liye haath kaata gaya tha — qeemat teen dirham thi.'"
"163","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Aslam [qabe ele] ka ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya; Nabi [Alaihissalam] ko bataya ke zina kiya hai; apne khilaf chaar baar gawahi di. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke baare mein hukm diya; sangsar karke maar diya gaya; woh shadishuda tha."
"164","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Ma'iz bin Malik Hiraq naami aadmi ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Hiraq! Falan ne zina kiya hai; kya raay hai? Us ne kaha: Nabi [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ke paas jaao. Tumhare baare mein Quran nazil hone se pehle — woh Nabi [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ke paas gaya aur bataya ke zina kiya hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne munh pher liya. Phir bataya; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne munh pher liya. Chaar baar hua [munh pherna]. Chauthi baar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sangsar ka hukm diya. Sangsar hua to darakht ki panah li; maar diya gaya. Ek aadmi ne saathi se kaha: Kutte jaisa maara gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [maut se phoole] gadhe ke paas aaye; donon se kaha: 'Is gadhe ka gosht nocho.' Donon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Badbudar murdar — gosht nochein? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bhai ke baare mein jo kaha, zyada badbudar hai. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Muhammad [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ki jaan hai! Woh jannat ki nehron mein gota laga raha hai.' Kaha jaata hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hiras se kaha: 'Ae Hiras! Us par reham kyun na kiya?'"
"165","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Yahoodi do Yahoodi [mard-aurat] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laaye; kaha: 'Donon par hadd qayam karenge?' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Donon par hadd qayam kyun nahin ki?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Qabu ho to karte hain, jaata rahe to nahin karte.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apne do bade aalim laao' — do Ibne Suriya laaye. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon se kaha: 'Baad walon se zyada ilm rakhte ho?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Yeh [Yahoodi] aisa samajhte hain.' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam deta hoon — jis ne Musa [Alaihissalam] par Taurat nazil ki — Taurat mein yeh hadd paate ho?' Donon ne kaha: 'Taurat mein paate hain: Jab aadmi ghar mein aurat ke saath tanhayi mein ho, donon pakde jayein — to donon ko chhod diya jaata hai, us mein saza hai; us ke saath leta paya jaaye — to chhod diya jaata hai, us mein saza hai; surma-dani mein surma-salayi jaisa poora dakhil ho — to sangsar hai.' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon ke baare mein hukm diya; sangsar kiye gaye. Kaha jaata hai is se pehle Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ma'iz bin Malik Al-Aslami (Raziyallahu anhu) ko sangsar kiya tha — jinhon ne apne khilaf chaar baar gawahi di thi; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke baare mein hukm diya; sangsar kiye gaye. Sha'bi [Rahimahullah] ne kaha: Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe sangsar ki jagah dikhayi."
"166","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ma'iz ko sangsar kiya tha; kodon ka zikr nahin kiya."
"167","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Aslami Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur zina ka iqrar kiya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Shayed bosa liya, haath se chhua ya dekha.'"
"168","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Zameen mein qayam ek hadd zameen walon ke liye tees subhon [dinon] ki barish se behtar hai.'"
"169","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ma'zoor shakhs laya gaya — Aap us waqt Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ke khalihanon [jahaan phal jama hote hain] ke paas the. Us ne [zina ka] iqrar kiya; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Khajoor ki daaliyon ke gatthe se maaro' — ya'ni khajoor ki daaliyon wali teeliyon se."
"170","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ki laundi zina kare to kode maaro, aazad na karo. Zina kare to kode maaro; zina kare to kode maaro; zina kare to bech do — chaahe baal ki rassi ya baal ki choti ke badle ho.'"
"171","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) o Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) donon bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se laundi ke baare mein poocha gaya — zina kare, shadishuda na ho — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Zina kare to kode maaro; phir zina kare to kode maaro; phir zina kare to kode maaro; phir bech do — chaahe baal ki rassi ke badle ho.' Teesri ya chauthi baar ke baad. 'Dhaafir' ya'ni rassi."
"172","[AI-translation] Ash'as bin Qais ne kaha: Kindah ke kuch logon ke saath Rasulullah [Alaihissalam] ke paas aaya; woh mujhe sab se afzal samajhte the. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Hum samajhte hain ke Aap [Alaihissalam] hum mein se hain? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Hum Banu Nadr bin Kinana hain; maan par jhooti tohmat nahin lagate, baap ka inkar nahin karte.' Ash'as ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Jab bhi Quraish ke kisi shakhs ke Nadr bin Kinana se nasab ke inkar ki baat sunta to zaroor kodon ki shar'i saza deta."
"173","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musalman kafir ka waris nahin hota; kafir Musalman ka waris nahin hota.'"
"174","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musalman kafir ka waris nahin hota.'"
"175","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Do [mukhtalif] deenon ke manne wale ek-doosre ke waris nahin hote.'"
"176","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wasiyyat se pehle qarz ada kiya — halanke tum padhte ho: [Wasiyyat ya qarz ke baad — Surah Nisa 12]. Sage bhai ek-doosre ke waris hote hain — sautele nahin — ya'ni baap-maan donon ke bhai — sirf baap ke nahin."
"177","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka aazad-karda khajoor ki daaliyan kaat raha tha — girkar mar gaya; kuch miras chhodi. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ko bataya gaya; farmaya: 'Aulad ya dost hain?' Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Shehar walon mein se kisi ko talash karo, yeh [maal] us ke hawale karo.'"
"178","[AI-translation] Khalid bin Abi Hayyan ne kaha: Banu Dinar ki ek aurat ne mujhe aazad kiya tha; phir Banu Salmah mein shaadi karke un se aulad hui; phir woh [aazad karne wali] mar gayein. Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] ke paas gaya; kuch logon ne kaha: Ae Abu Abdullah! Yeh tumhare 'wala' ke baare mein poochega. Main ne kaha: Allah ki panah chahta hoon! Main falan Deenari aurat ka aazad-karda hoon. Jabir [Raziyallahu anhu] ne kaha: Haan, ae bhanje! Main gawahi deta hoon ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo apne aaqaon ke siwa kisi aur ko aaqa banaye, iman ka phanda gale se utar phenka' — aur haath se aise teen baar ishara kar rahe the."
"179","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Ek aurat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aayi — shauhar ke [khoonbaha] se miras maangi; Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Khoonbaha sirf asbah [mard rishtedaron] ka hai; tumhare liye kuch nahin jaanta.' Mu'ammar ne kaha: Samjha ke khoonbaha sirf asbah ka hai — kyunke wohi dete hain. Phir logon se mashwara karke kaha: 'Is baare mein kisi ko ilm hai?' Dahhak bin Sufiyan Al-Kilabi (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe likha tha ke Ashyam Zibabi ki biwi ko shauhar ke khoonbaha se waris karoon; Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use waris kiya."
"180","[AI-translation] Zuhri [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Aashim ka qatl ghalti se qatl tha."
"181","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko walid ki qasam khaate paya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah tumhein baap-dada ki qasam se mana karta hai. Qasam khani ho to Allah ki qasam khaao ya khamosh raho.'"
"182","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ke siwa kisi aur ki qasam khaye...' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is baare mein bahut sakht farmaya."
"183","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aksar is qasam se qasam khaate the: Aap [Alaihissalam] kehte: 'Nahin, dilon ko pherne wale ki qasam.'"
"184","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: 'Tumhare walid ki qasam!' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah tumhein baapon ki qasam se mana karta hai.' Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Allah ki qasam! Is ke baad kabhi qasam nahin khayi — qasdan ya naqlan.'"
"185","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdurrahman bin Auf Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke sahaba mein se ek Ansari se bayan karte hain: Makkah fatah ke din ek Ansari Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Main ne mannat maani thi ke agar Allah Nabi [Alaihissalam] o mominon ko Makkah fatah de to Baitul-Maqdis mein imamat karke namaz padhoon ga; Quraish mein Sham ke ek aadmi ko mere saath aane-jaane mein haqeer paya hai.' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Yahaan namaz padho.' Us ne teen baar baat dohraayi; har baar Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne use kaha: 'Yahaan namaz padho.' Chauthi baar dohrane par Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'To jaao, wahaan namaz padho. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Muhammad [Alaihissalam] ko haqq ke saath bheja! Yahaan namaz padhoge to goya Baitul-Maqdis mein namaz padhi.' Ibne Juraij [Rahimahullah] ne kaha: Aadmi Banu Saqeef ka Shuraid bin Suwaid bin Sadaf tha."
"186","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mannat se mana kiya; farmaya: 'Yeh kuch nahin pherti; is se bakheel se sirf kuch nikala jaata hai.'"
"187","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se wahi hadees bayan hui."
"188","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki nafarmani mein mannat nahin; us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai.'"
"189","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Jahiliyyat mein mannat maani thi ke Masjidul-Haram mein ek raat e'tikaf karoon ga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mannat poori karo.'"
"190","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Hunain se laute to Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jahiliyyat mein maani mannat ke baare mein poocha — ya'ni ek din ke e'tikaf [masjid mein goshanashini] ki mannat. Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne poora karne ka hukm diya."
"191","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Sa'd bin Ubadah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se walidah par rahi mannat ke baare mein fatwa maanga — woh poora karne se pehle mar gayein; Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne poora karne ka hukm diya."
"192","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: '[Is tarah] na kaho: Allah ne jo chaha aur falan ne chaha; kaho: Allah ne jo chaha, phir falan ne chaha.'"
"193","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Ek aadmi Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kuch baatein karke kaha: 'Allah jo chahe aur aap chahein.' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe Allah ke barabar kiya? Kaho: Sirf Allah jo chahe.'"
"194","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein hum ghode ka gosht khaate the."
"195","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne gadhe ka gosht [khana] mana kiya; ghode ke gosht ka hukm diya."
"196","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Asma binte Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan kartin hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ghoda zibah karke gosht khaya."
"197","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne Khaibar ke din gharelu gadhe ka gosht mana kiya."
"198","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Khaibar ke din laundiyan milein; un ke saath azl [mani bahar nikalna] karte the; un ke gharwale fidya denge ya nahin talash rahe the. Kisi ne kisi se kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) beech mein hote yeh kar rahe ho?' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke paas aaye aur zikr kiya. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Har qatra paani [mani] se bachcha nahin hota. Allah mu'amla tay kare to hota hai.' Kehte hain: Nabi [Alaihissalam] ubalti handiyon ke paas se guzre; poocha: 'Kya gosht hai?' Kaha: 'Gadhe ka gosht.' Poocha: 'Gharelu ya jangli?' Kaha: 'Nahin, gharelu.' Aap [Alaihissalam] ne hum se kaha: 'Undel do.' Undel diya; bhooke the, chahte the. Kehte hain: 'Mashkon ke munh rassi se baandhne ka hukm diya gaya tha.'"
"199","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'labah Al-Khushani (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne gadhe ka gosht o daanton wala har darinda mana kiya."
"200","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'labah Al-Khushani (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne darindon mein daanton wala har janwar mana kiya."
"201","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se wahi hadees bayan hui."
"202","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Abdullah As-Sa'di [Rahimahullah] kehte hain: Sa'id bin Musayyib [Rahimahullah] se bijju [janwar] ke baare mein poocha; unhon ne kaha: 'Is ka khana jayez nahin; kya koi khaata hai?' Main ne kaha: Meri qaum ke kuch log uthakar khaate hain. Unhon ne kaha: 'Is ka khana jayez nahin.' Un ke saathi ek shaikh ne kaha: 'Chaho to sunaoon Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kya kaha.' Unhon ne kaha: Unhein kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne har dakaiti, chheenajhapti, nishana banakar maara janwar aur daanton wala har darinda mana kiya. Sa'id bin Musayyib [Rahimahullah] ne kaha: 'Sach kaha.'"
"203","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Khargosh dekha, talash mein nikla, thak gaya. Pakda; Abu Talha (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas laya. Unhon ne zibah karke raan samet Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas bheja. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne qabool kiya."
"204","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Saanp hadd se badha; bijju hadd se badha; chooha hadd se badha; kauwa hadd se badha.' Kaha jaata hai ek aadmi ne Qasim bin Muhammad se poocha: 'Kauwa khaya ja sakta hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman ke baad woh hadd se badha hai. Kaun khayega?"
"205","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Khalid bin Waleed — Allah ki talwar (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath Sayyidah Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) ke ghar gaya. Woh Nabi [Alaihissalam] ki biwi thein; Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) o Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ki khala. Wahaan bhuni goh payi — behen Hafeedah binte Haris Najd se laayi thein. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saamne goh rakhi; Aap [Alaihissalam] khaane ki taraf haath badhate na the — jab tak bataya na jaaye, naam zikr na ho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne goh ki taraf haath badhaya; hazir auraton mein se ek ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jo diya, batao.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Yeh goh hai.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne goh se haath kheencha. Khalid bin Waleed (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Goh haram — ae Allah ke Rasul?' Farmaya: 'Nahin; meri qaum ki zameen mein nahin payi jaati; tabiyat napasand karti hai.' Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Kheenchkar khaya; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dekh rahe the, mana nahin kiya.'"
"206","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dekha ke un ki chhoti bakri ghayab hai; unhon ne bataya ke mar gayi hai. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Chamda lekar fayda kyun nahin uthaya?'"
"207","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Murdar janwaron ki khaalon se fayda uthao jab dabaghat ho jayein.'"
"208","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Fatah ke saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Makkah mein rehte suna — farma rahe the: 'Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] ne sharab, murdar o su'ar ke gosht ki tijarat haram ki hai.' Poocha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Murdar ki charbi ke baare mein kya raay hai? Is se mashkein chiknayi jaati hain, chamda chiknaya jaata hai, log charagh jalate hain. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Nahin, haram hai.' Yahoodiyon ko Allah halak kare — Allah ne charbi haram ki to pighlakar becha, qeemat khayi."
"209","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chehre par daagh o chehre par maar mana ki."
"210","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne cheenti, shehad ki makkhi, hudhud o qasai chidiya maarna mana kiya."
"211","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Cheentiyon ki basti mein ek cheenti ne Nabi ko kaata; unhon ne woh basti jala di. Allah ne wahi ki: Ek cheenti ne kaata; tasbeeh karne wali ummaton mein poori ummat halak kar di.'"
"212","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Meri walidah ne maal mein se mere liye walid se tohfa maanga. Ek saal taala; phir tohfa dene ka khayal aaya; walidah ne kaha: 'Mere bete ko diye tohfe par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko gawah na karne tak raazi nahin hoon gi.' Haath pakda — tab bachcha tha — Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke paas laaye; kaha: 'Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! In ki walidah — Rawahah ki beti — ek saal se is bete ko tohfa dene par israr kar rahi hai; ab tohfa dene ka khayal aaya. Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Woh chahtin hain gawah banaya jaaye.' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Ae Bashir! Is ke siwa aulad hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Mera khayal hai Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Is par mujhe gawah na banao.'"
"213","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain — woh khutba de rahe the: Walid mujhe Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke paas laaye — mujhe diye tohfe par gawah karne ke liye. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Is ke siwa aur bete hain?' Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Barabar sulook karo.'"
"214","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hamare liye buri misaal nahin. Tohfa wapas lene wala kutte jaisa hai — ulti ki taraf lautta hai.'"
"215","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Ek aadmi ne tohfa dekar wapas liya; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh kutte ki misaal hai — khaata hai, pet bharne par pet ka sab ulti karta hai; phir khaata hai.' Amr bin Shu'aib [Rahimahullah] ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul-Aziz [Rahimahullah] ke khilafat mein un ke paas hazir tha; unhon ne ek aadmi ke liye yeh hadees sunayi."
"216","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar o Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) marfu bayan karte hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: Aap ne farmaya: 'Bete ko diye baap ke siwa tohfa dekar wapas lena kisi ke liye halal nahin. Tohfa dekar wapas lene ki misaal kutte jaisi hai — khaata hai, pet bharne par ulti karta hai; ulti ki taraf lautta hai.'"
"217","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Ruqba ke taur par kuch na do; jo ruqba kare, woh us ka hai. Aur umra ke taur par kuch na do; jo umra kare, woh us ka hai.'"
"218","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ali kehte hain: Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha: 'Umra [qism ka tohfa] ke baare mein kya kehte ho?' Main ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use qabool kiya.' Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Gawahi deta hoon ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yeh suna hai.'"
"219","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Umra waris ke liye hai.'"
"220","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Umra jayez hai.'"
"221","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Umra us ke warison ke liye jayez hai — ya us ke warison ki miras hai.'"
"222","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi hadees bayan karte hain."
"223","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi hadees bayan karte hain."
"224","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah fatah ke din farmaya: 'Kisi aurat ke liye shauhar ki ijazat ke baghair tohfa dena jayez nahin.'"
"225","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sadqa wapas lene wale ki misaal kutte jaisi hai — ulti ki taraf lautkar khaata hai.'"
"226","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Khaibar mein zameen payi; Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Khaibar mein zameen payi hai. Allah ki qasam! Is se pyara maal kabhi nahin paya. Kya mashwara dete hain? Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Chaho to sadqa karo, asl roke rakho.' Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne sadqa kiya — asl na becha jaaye, na diya jaaye, na miras ho. Ghareebon, rishtedaron, Allah ki raah, ghulam aazadi, musafiron-mehmanon ke liye sadqa kiya. Mutawalli par gunah nahin — achhe tareeqe se khaye, dost ko khilaye; maal na banaye. Muhammad ko yeh hadees sunayi; 'maal na banaye' pohncha to unhon ne kaha: Is mein maal maangne wala koi na ho. Ek aadmi ne bataya: Woh tehreer padhi hai — jis mein likha tha is mein maal maangne wala koi na ho."
"227","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Abi Ja'd [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Shurahbil bin Simt ne Marrah bin Ka'b ya Ka'b bin Marrah ko bulakar kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees sunao, [Allah se] daro. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Musalman [mard] ghulam aazad kare to us ke ang ke badle Allah us ka ang jahannam se aazad karega; Musalman aurat [laundi] aazad kare to us ke ang ke badle Allah us ka ang jahannam se aazad karega.'"
"228","[AI-translation] Ghuraif bin Iyash bin Farqad Ad-Dailami ne kaha: Wasilah bin Asqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya; [Kilab] ne un se kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees sunao.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Haan, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath Tabuk jang mein nikle. Banu Sulaim ka giroh Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke paas aaya; hamare ek saathi ne us se kaha: Us ne lazim kiya hai. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: Is ke badle waisi hi gardan aazad kare. Us ke har ang ke liye Allah us ka ang jahannam se aazad karega.'"
"229","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kayi shareekon ke mushtaraka ghulam-laundi ke baare mein kehte the — ek hissa aazad kare to poora ghulam aazad karna lazim — aazad karne wale ke paas baqi hisson ki qeemat ka maal ho to. Maal se munasib qeemat lagegi; doosre shareekon ko hisse lautaega; aazad ka raasta poori tarah aazad hoga. Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi [Alaihissalam] se yeh bayan karte hain."
"230","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Do aadmi ghulam mein shareek hon, ek hissa aazad kare to aazad karne wale par lazim hai — maal ho to — ghulam ki baqi qeemat ada ki jaaye.'"
"231","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi hadees bayan karte hain."
"232","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Ghulam ka hissa aazad kare to apne maal se poora aazad karna lazim hai. Maal na ho to ghulam ki qeemat munasib lagegi; kamane [adaygi mein] ko kaha jayega; mashaqqat nahin daali jayegi.'"
"233","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Utbah bin Abi Waqqas ne bhai Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha — Utbah kafir tha, Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) Musalman — 'Tumhein wasiyyat karta hoon ke Zam'ah ki laundi ka beta mera beta hai; Zam'ah Banu Aamir bin Lu'ayy ka fard tha. Zam'ah ki laundi ke bete ko paao to le lo.' Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) kehtin hain: Fatah [Makkah] ka din aaya to Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Zam'ah ki laundi ke bete ko pakar kaha: 'Bhatija' — gale lagaya. Abd bin Zam'ah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Balke woh mera bhai hai; walid ke bistar par paida hua — laundi se.' Donon ne Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jhagda rakha; Abd bin Zam'ah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Balke woh tumhara bhai hai; walid ke bistar par paida hua — laundi se.' Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) kehtin hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dekha aur Utbah ki mushabahat dekhi — jo logon ne pehle wazeh nahin dekhi thi. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Woh tumhara hai — ae Abd bin Zam'ah! Bachcha bistar [wale] ka hai; ae Saudah (Raziyallahu anha)! Us se parda karo.' Wafat tak use na dekha."
"234","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Meri laundi hai; us ke paas jaana chahta hoon, [hamal] rokna chahta hoon.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Suno! Allah jo chahe — yeh zaroor nahin rokega' — ya farmaya: 'Allah jo chahe — kuch nahin rok sakta.' Phir woh aadmi aaya aur kaha: 'Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Meri laundi ne bachcha jana hai.'"
"235","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath the; Banu Fazara ka dehati aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Biwi ne kala bachcha jana hai — tab woh inkar kar raha tha — [bachche] se talluq todne ko hi kaha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Oont hain?' Us ne kaha: Haan. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Rang kya?' Us ne kaha: Laal. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne us se kaha: 'Bhoore hain?' Us ne kaha: Haan, raakh-rang oont hain. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne us se kaha: 'Yeh kahaan se aaye?' Us ne kaha: Nahin jaanta — koi nasab kheench laya hoga. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Shayed koi nasab is [bachche] ko bhi kheench laya ho.' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne [bachche] se talluq todne ki ijazat dene se inkar kiya."
"236","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Qarzdar hote hue ek aadmi ne ghulam aazad kiya; mohtaj hua. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use lekar kaha: 'Kaun mujh se khareedega?' Na'im bin Abdullah ne itne mein khareeda; Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne use saunpa."
"237","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne 'wala' bechna o dena mana kiya; Ubaidullah dena zikr karna bhoole ya zikr nahin kiya."
"238","[AI-translation] Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Barirah aayi aur kaha: Aaqaon ne saat uqiya mein mukti-mukatabat likhi hai — har saal ek uqiya [chalees dirham] — madad karo. Unhon ne [Ayesha] kaha: Aaqa raazi hon to ek baar poori doon; lekin tumhara 'wala' [wafadari] mera hoga. Aaqaon ke paas gayi; unhon ne inkar kiya; Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas lauti — Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) saath the; kaha: Pesh kiya; unhon ne inkar kiya — 'wala' un ka hoga siwa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sunkar Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) se poocha; unhon ne poora bataya. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'To khareedo, aazad karo; un ke liye wala ki shart karo; wala aazad karne wale ka hai.' Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) ne aisa kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) din ke aakhir mein logon mein khade hue; Allah ki hamd-tazeem karke kaha: 'Amma ba'd! Tumhare kuch logon ko kya hua — Allah ki kitab mein nahin aisi shartein karte? Allah ki kitab mein nahin aisi shart batil — sau hon to bhi. Allah ka faisla zyada haqdar; Allah ki shart mazboot. Tum mein se ek ko kya hua — kehta hai aazad kiya, wala mera? Wala sirf aazad karne wale ka hai.'"
"239","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Rishtedar ka malik hua to aazad hai.'"
"240","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: 'Teen hain: sab ki madad karna Allah par haqq hai — Allah ki raah mein jihad karne wala; pakdamani chahkar shaadi karne wala; mukti-mukatabat karke poora karne ki niyyat wala ghulam.'"
"241","[AI-translation] Sha'bi [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Qarza ne Banu Abdul-Ashhal ke kuch logon ke saath Iraq jaane ka irada kiya. Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) un ke saath nikle; paani maangkar wuzu karke kaha: 'Jaante ho kyun nikla hoon?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Hamari muhabbat o haqq ki wajah se.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Haqq hai; lekin ek baat kehne aaya hoon: Nabi [Alaihissalam] se kam hadees bayan karo; is mein [pabandi mein] main tumhara shareek hoon.' [Sha'bi] ne kaha: 'Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki is baat ke baad Nabi [Alaihissalam] se hadees bayan na karta tha.'"
"242","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: [Sha'bi kehte hain] Phir woh [Ibne Mas'ud Raziyallahu anhu] fikr se kaanpne lage — ya kaha kaanpne lage; kaha: Is ke oopar ya neeche — aur aise."
"243","[AI-translation] Amr bin Maimun [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Ek saal Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aata-jaata tha. Tab nahin suna ke unhon ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya — ek hadees siwa, jo zaroor bayan karte; 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya' kehne lage to badi fikr chha gayi — peshani se paseene ki boondein tapakti dekhein. Kaha: Allah chahe — ya is ke oopar — ya aise — ya qareeb. [Nabi Alaihissalam ne farmaya]."
"244","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain: Hum hadees yaad karte the; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadees yaad rehti — sahaba [Raziyallahu anhum] is ke liye har mushkil ka samna karke ghalib aaye."
"245","[AI-translation] Sa'ib bin Yazid [Rahimahullah] kehte hain: Sa'd bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ke saath Madinah se Makkah nikla; lautne tak Nabi [Alaihissalam] se ek bhi hadees nahin suni. Hammad kehte hain: [Yeh] Nabi [Alaihissalam] se bayan ki tazeem-sanjeedgi se; hamari haalat — hamare o Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke darmiyan aisi-aisi [hadeesein] bayan karke zaya karte hain."
"246","[AI-translation] Abu Nadrah kehte hain: Abu Sa'id [Khudri] (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pyari hadeesein sunate hain; likh lein to? Unhon ne kaha: Likho; Quran nahin banaoon ga."
"247","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Mahmud bin Rabi' (Raziyallahu anhu) Itban bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan karte hain: Unhon ne unhein Ibne Dukhaishum (Raziyallahu anhu) ke baare mein hadees sunayi. Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Madinah aaya; Itban (Raziyallahu anhu) se mila; unhon ne hadees sunayi. Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Hadees bahut pasand aayi; bete ko likhne ko kaha; us ne likha."
"248","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ek aadmi aaya aur kuch poocha. Use hadees sunayi. Aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki kitab se sunao, aur kuch se nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Tum bewaqoof ho. Quran mein paate ho Zohar chaar rak'at, zor se nahin padhi jaati, namazon ki tadad, zakat ki miqdar? Kaha: Allah ki kitab mein tafseel paate ho? Allah ki kitab ne qat'i kaha hai; sunnat wazahat karti hai."
"249","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif kehte hain: Mere walid ne Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Ae chacha! Log ab woh log nahin — jin mein waqt guzarte the; ab woh kapdon mein bhediye hain; un se bacho. Unhon ne jawab diya: Suno, Allah ki qasam! Agar yeh kaha hai to qareeb mein un se shak mein pad gaya hoon — Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees sunata hoon to kehte hain: Apne kaanon se suna?"
"250","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo haqq ke saath zuban seedhi rakhe, phir us par amal kare — qiyamat tak ajr jaari rehta hai; qiyamat ke din Allah use poora ajr dega.'"
"251","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan khade hue — jaise main tumhare darmiyan khada hoon; Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa mabood nahin! Jo gawahi de Allah ke siwa mabood nahin, main Allah ka Rasul hoon — us ka khoon halal nahin — teen mein se ek siwa: jaan ke badle jaan; shadishuda zani; jama'at se alag — deen chhodne wala — ya kaha: Islam chhodne wala.'"
"252","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Sanabihi (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Haudh [Kausar] par tum se aage jaoon ga; doosri ummaton ke saamne tumhari kasrat par fakhr karoon ga. Mere baad aapas mein bilkul jang na karo.'"
"253","[AI-translation] Abdurrahman bin A'idh bayan karte hain: Sayyiduna Uqbah bin Aamir (Raziyallahu anhu) Masjidul-Aqsa aaye aur namaz padhi. Kuch logon se mile; woh saath chalne lage. Poocha: 'Kaise aaye?' Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sohbat thi. 'Tumhein salam karne, sunne aaye hain.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Utro, namaz padho.' Phir kaha: 'Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo mare — Allah ke saath kuch shirk na kare, haram khoon na bahaye — jannat ke jis darwaze se chahe dakhil hoga.'"
"254","[AI-translation] Abu Nadrah [Rahimahullah] bayan karte hain: Mina mein Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke khutbe mein hazir shakhs ne mujhe yeh hadees sunayi. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreeq ke dinon mein khade hokar farmaya: 'Ae logo! Tumhara Rabb ek hai; tumhara baap ek hai. Suno! Arabi ko ajami par, ajami ko arabi par, kaale ko surkh par, surkh ko kaale par fazeelat nahin — Allah ke taqwe siwa. Dekho! Pohnchaya?' Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pohnchaya. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Hazir ghayab ko pohnchaye.' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Kaun-sa mahina?' Unhon ne kaha: Haram mahina. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Kaun-sa din?' Unhon ne kaha: Haram din. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Kaun-sa shehar?' Unhon ne kaha: Haram shehar. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Tumhara khoon-maal [rawi kehte hain: khayal hai kaha: izzat] haram hai — is shehar ki hurmat jaise — is mahine mein — is din mein. Dekho! Pohnchaya?' Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pohnchaya. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Hazir ghair-hazir ko pohnchaye.'"
"255","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Logon se jang ka hukm mila hai — jab tak gawahi dein Allah ke siwa mabood nahin, Muhammad [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] Allah ke Rasul hain. Yeh kahein, hamare qible ki taraf munh karein, zabiha khayein, namaz padhein — to un ka khoon-maal hamare liye haram — haqq siwa. Un ke liye Musalmanon ke huqooq; un par Musalmanon ki zimmedariyan.'"
"256","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Jabiyah [jagah] mein khutba dekar kaha: Hamare darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue the — jaise main tumhare darmiyan khada hoon; Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Sahaba [Raziyallahu anhum] ke baare mein bhalayi ki wasiyyat qabool karo; phir baad walon ke; phir baad walon ke. Phir jhoot phailega — maange jaane se pehle gawahi dene lagega; talab se pehle qasam khaane lagega. Tum mein se jo jannat ka beech chahe, jama'at pakde; shaitan akele ke saath hai — do se door. Tum mein se koi aurat ke saath tanhayi mein ho to shaitan teesra hai. Jise neki khush kare, gunah ranjeeda kare — woh momin hai.'"
"257","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Umme Salmah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum par hukmaran honge — apne huqooq pehchanenge, tumhare huqooq inkar karenge. Jo radd kare, najat pa gaya; jo napasand kare, mehfooz; lekin jo raazi ho, pairwi kare...' Poocha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Jang na karein? Farmaya: 'Nahin — jab tak namaz qayam karein.'"
"258","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Auf bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Tumhare behtareen hukmaran — jinhein chaho, woh tumhein chahein; tum un ke liye dua karo, woh tumhare liye dua karein. Tumhare badtareen hukmaran — jin se nafrat karo, woh tum se nafrat karein; tum unhein la'nat karo, woh tumhein la'nat karein.' Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Tab jang ka elan na karein? Farmaya: 'Nahin — jab tak namaz qayam karein. Hakim ke tehat koi Allah ki nafarmani dekhe — nafarmani napasand kare; ita'at se haath na kheenche.'"
"259","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah [bin Mas'ud] (Raziyallahu anhu) — woh Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: Aap ne farmaya: 'Qareeb khudgharzi, fitne o aisi baatein hongi — jo napasand karoge.' Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Jo paye — use kya hukm dete hain? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Tum par rahe huqooq ada karo; apne huqooq Allah se maango.'"
"260","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se kaha: 'Ae Abu Zarr! Kya karoge jab log bhooke honge — bistar se masjid, masjid se bistar uthne ki taqat na hogi?' Main ne kaha: Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] behtar jaante hain. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Pakdamani apnao.' Phir Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Kya karoge jab log marenge — ghar naukar samet hoga?' Main ne kaha: Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] behtar jaante hain. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Sabr karo.' Phir Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Kya karoge jab log aapas mein ladenge — bhediye ki maand bhi pehchani jayegi?' Main ne kaha: Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] behtar jaante hain. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'To jahaan ke ho wahaan jaao.' Main ne kaha: Mere paas aaye to kya raay hai? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Ghar mein dakhil ho.' Main ne kaha: Phir bhi aaye to kya raay hai? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Talwar ki chamak ghalib aane ka darr ho to kapde ka kinara munh par rakho; woh tumhara gunah o apna gunah lekar lautega.' Main ne kaha: Hathiyar na uthaoon? Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'To shareek ban jaoge.'"
"261","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdul-Malik bayan karte hain: Mughirah bin Shobah (Raziyallahu anhu) Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaye — woh darwaze par the; [baghiyon] ne ghera tha. [Mughirah Raziyallahu anhu] ne kaha: Teen mein se ek chuno: jahaan woh [baghi] hain, us ke siwa doosra darwaza jala dein — niklo, sawari par chadhkar Makkah jaao; wahaan rehte tum se itminan na payenge. Ya sawari par chadhkar Sham [Syria] jaao; woh Sham wale hain — un mein Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) hain. Ya sathiyon ko lekar niklo; tadad-taqat hai — jang karo; tum haqq par ho, woh batil par. Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Sawari par chadhkar Makkah jaane ki salah — wahaan rehte mujh se itminan na payenge. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Quraish ka ek aadmi Makkah mein ilhad karega — us par jahanon ka azab undela jayega' — main woh nahin hoon ga. Sham jaane ki salah — woh Sham wale hain — un mein Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) hain — lekin hijratgah o Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hamsaygi nahin chhodoon ga. Sathiyon ko lekar nikalne ki salah — nahaqq khoon se sheeshi bharkar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka pehla mukhalif nahin hoon ga."
"262","[AI-translation] Abu Burdah bin Abi Musa bayan karte hain: 'Rabzah' se guzre; achanak khema-shamiyana. Poocha: 'Kiska?' Kaha gaya: Muhammad bin Maslamah (Raziyallahu anhu) ka. Un ke paas gaya aur kaha: Allah tum par reham kare. Logon ke paas kyun nahin nikalte? Is muamle mein aise maqam par ho — baat suni jayegi. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qareeb fitna-iftiraq hoga; Uhud ki chaudayi par talwar maaro, teer todo, kaman ki dori kaato, ghar baitho.' Unhon ne kaha: Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne jo hukm diya, hoobahoo kiya; achanak kheme ke sutun se talwar bandhi thi. Kheencha — lakdi ki talwar. Kaha: Talwar se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jo hukm diya, hoobahoo kiya; tayyar ki; is se logon ko darata hoon."
"263","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qiyamat se pehle aise fitne honge — jaise andheri raat ke tukde. Aadmi subah momin, shaam kafir hoga; shaam momin, subah kafir hoga. Log deen ka hissa thode dunyawi maal ke badle bechenge — ya [kaha] duniya ke badle.'"
"264","[AI-translation] Hasan kehte hain: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa mabood nahin — unhein dekha hai: shaklein hain, aql nahin; jism hain, fehm-shu'oor nahin. Woh aag ke parwane — lalach-khwahish ki makkhiyan hain. Subah do dirham lekar nikalte hain, do dirham lekar lautte hain. Ek bakri ki qeemat par deen bechta hai."
"265","[AI-translation] Umme Salmah (Raziyallahu anha) bayan kartin hain: Ek din mimbar se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Ae logo!' Kehtin hain: Tab baal kanghi kara rahi thi; kanghi karne wali aurat se kaha: 'Afsos tum par, sir chhodo.' Aurat ne kaha: 'Nabi [Alaihissalam] sirf logon ko pukar rahe hain.' Kaha: 'Kya hum logon mein nahin?' Sir lapetkar hujre ke peeche khadi hui aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Ae logo! Haudh [Kausar] par us waqt hoon ga — tum girohon mein guzare jaoge; mukhtalif raaston par le jaaye jaoge. Pukaroon ga: Suno! Is raaste aao. Phir peeche se munadi pukarega: Tumhare baad unhon ne [deen] badal diya. Kahoon ga: Khabardar! Door, door.'"
"266","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abi Abdurrahman bin Labibah bayan karte hain: Umar bin Sa'd walid [Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas Raziyallahu anhu] ke paas gaye — woh Aqiq mein alag zameen par the; kaha: Ae walid! Badri sahaba o shoora walon mein tum [Raziyallahu anhu] ke siwa koi nahin bacha. Uthkar logon ke liye khade ho to do bhi ikhtilaf nahin karenge. Unhon ne kaha: Ae bete! Jawab doon ga. Baitha raha — jaan janwar ke tez guzarne jaisi baqi — phir nikalkar Muhammad [Alaihissalam] ki ummat ke kuch ko kuch se ladaoon? Rasulullah [Alaihissalam] ko farmate suna: 'Behtareen rozi jo kaafi ho; behtareen zikr jo chhipa ho.'"
"267","[AI-translation] Qais bin Abad bayan karte hain: Hum ne Ammar (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Tumhari jang ke baare mein kya raay hai — yeh tumhari banayi raay hai — raay ghalat-sahi ho sakti hai — ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tum se ahd kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hum se aisa ahd nahin kiya — jo aur sab logon se na kiya ho."
"268","[AI-translation] Qais bin Abad kehte hain: Hum Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke saath the. Jab bhi majlis mein aate, pahad chadhte ya waadi utarte to Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] ki tasdeeq karte. Banu Yashkur ke ek aadmi se kaha: 'Amirul-mominin ke paas chalo — un ki baat ke baare mein poochein: Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] ne sach kaha.' Un ke paas jakar kaha: 'Ae Amirul-mominin! Dekha hai jab bhi majlis mein aate ya pahad chadhte kehte hain: Allah o us ke Rasul [Alaihissalam] ne sach kaha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is baare mein ahd kiya hai?' Unhon ne munh phera; israr kiya to kaha: 'Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se ahd nahin kiya — logon se jo liya siwa. Lekin logon ne Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) par hamla karke shaheed kiya; mere siwa is [khilafat] baare mein mujh se badtar haal-amal wala koi na tha. Samjha inse zyada haqqdar hoon; qabool kiya. Allah behtar jaanta hai sahi the ya ghalat.'"
"269","[AI-translation] Qutbah bin Malik kehte hain: Mughirah bin Shobah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ali bin Abi Talib kaun hai? Zaid bin Arqam (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: Suno! Jaante ho Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne murdon ki burayi mana ki hai; Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) mar gaye to un ki burayi kyun kar rahe ho?"
"270","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ibne Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko dafan se pehle charpayi par rakha to log ghirkar dua karne lage. Main un mein tha. Ek ne mujhe fikrmand kiya — peeche se kandha pakda. Palkar dekha to Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) the. Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke liye rehmat ki dua karke kaha: 'Tum se zyada jis ke aamal se Allah se milna chahoon — aisa koi peeche nahin chhoda. Allah ki qasam! Yaqeen hai Allah tumhein do sathiyon [Rasulullah Alaihissalam o Abu Bakr Raziyallahu anhu] se milayega; wajah hai aksar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Gaya — Abu Bakr-Umar gaye; dakhil hua — Abu Bakr-Umar dakhil hue; nikla — Abu Bakr-Umar nikle. Yaqeen hai Allah zaroor donon se tumhein milayega.'"
"271","[AI-translation] Abu Imran Jauni [Rahimahullah] kehte hain: Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) se bai'at ki hai — Sham walon se jang karoon ga. Unhon ne kaha: Shayad ghoomkar kehna chahte ho: Jundub ne mujhe yeh kaha, woh kaha. Main ne kaha: Nahin, sirf fatwa maang raha hoon; fatwa do. Unhon ne kaha: Maal se khud ko chhudao. Main ne kaha: Yeh mujh se qabool nahin hoga. Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein taqatwar jawan tha; falan [sahabi] ne mujhe kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Qiyamat ke din maqtool qatil ko pakde aayega; kahega: Ae Rabb! Us ne mujhe maara. Allah us se kahega: Kyun maara? Woh kahega: Falan ki badshahat ke liye. Is liye chahta hoon tum woh na ho.'"
"272","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musalman ke qatl mein sirf halakat hai' — teen baar kaha."
"273","[AI-translation] Ibne Hanifah [Rahimahullah] kehte hain: Sab log mujhe bai'at dein — ek aadmi siwa — us ke baghair hukoomat qayam na ho — to yeh [bai'at] qabool nahin karoon ga."
"274","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Nabi [Alaihissalam] ke ird-gird the; achanak Aap ne fitne ka zikr kiya — ya Aap ko zikr kiya gaya; Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Dekhoge logon ke ahd bigad gaye hain, amanatein halki hui hain; aise ho gaye hain.' Aap [Alaihissalam] ne ungliyan goontheein. Nabi [Alaihissalam] ki taraf uthkar kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Tab kya karoon? Allah tumhare liye mujhe fidya kare. Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Ghar pakdo; zuban roko; jo pehchano lo; jo inkar karo chhodo. Khud ko khaas fikr banao; aam logon ko chhodo.'"
"275","[AI-translation] Haroon bin Sa'd bayan karte hain: Hanif bin Sazq Rabzah ki jagah mein Sham walon ki Ibne Diljah ki fauj se mila, jang karke shikast di. Hanif Madinah aaya aur Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se mila aur kaha: Ae Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma)! Ibne Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) se peeche rehna kya hai? Purane bhai nahin ho? Tumhari der se log peeche reh rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ibne Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) — munh mein haath rakha; kaha: Munh mein haath rakhna mane jaante ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Doodh pilane wali aurat nahin dekhi — mutmain ya pet bharne par beraghbat hokar munh mein haath rakhta hai; maan kehti hai: Munh mein haath rakha. Allah ki qasam! Bhaari oont jaisa hoon ga. Bhaari oont kya jaante ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Oont alag hokar baithta hai — baithne ki jagah rehta hai jab tak wahein zibah ho. Main bhi woh oont hoon. Ghar mein mehdood rahoon ga — mujhe zibah karne wala aane ya log ek par jama hone tak; nek giroh par jama hon to [sahi]; bikhar jayein to un ki iftiraq mein jama nahin hoon ga; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate sunne ke baad do ki [bai'at] nahin karoon ga: 'Allah jise riaya ki zimmedari de — qiyamat ke din poocha jayega: Allah ka hukm qayam kiya ya ghaflat ki — gharwale baare bhi poocha jayega: Allah ka hukm qayam kiya ya ghaflat ki.'"
"276","[AI-translation] Rabi' bin Hirash bayan karte hain: Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke janaze mein ek aadmi ko kehte suna: Charpayi wale ko kehte suna: 'Eteraz nahin — Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate sunne ke baad: Lekin jang karo to ghar mein dakhil hoon ga; koi mere paas aaye to kahoon ga: Aao, apne gunah samet mera gunah uthao.'"
"277","[AI-translation] Usaid bin Mutashammis bin Mu'awiyah bayan karte hain: Abu Musa [Ash'ari] (Raziyallahu anhu) ke saath Isfahan ki jang ladi. Thodi der baad fatah kiya; kuch der baad laute; hum bhi laute. Jagah mein padao kiya; Aaqil padosi tha. [Abu Musa Ash'ari Raziyallahu anhu] ne kaha: 'Takiya kaun utarega?' Un ki taraf uthkar utara. Unhon ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamein jo sunate the, na sunaoon?' Kaha: 'Kyun nahin, Allah tum par reham kare.' Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qiyamat se pehle harj hoga.' Poocha: 'Harj kya?' Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Qatl-khoonrezi.' Kaha: 'Har saal aksar kafir maare jaate hain. Saal mein itne kafir maarte hain.' Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Kafiron ka maarna woh harj nahin — balke qatl hoga sulah [ya'ni Islam walon mein] — ae Musalmanon ke giroh! Padosi, chachazad bhai, bhai, baap ko marega.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Hairan-haqqa-baqqa hue — koi aankh nahin khol raha tha. Kisi ne kisi ki taraf dekhkar kaha: Bhai, chachazad bhai, baap ko kaise marega — muhabbat-ulfat jo Allah ne us din dilon mein rakhi hai? Jaante hain saathi ne jhoot nahin kaha.' Kaha: 'Kya raay hai, aaj ki aqlein us din hongi?' Aap [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Nahin, Allah ki qasam! [Shaitan] aqlon mein iftiraq dalega — us din ke logon jaise; log is ke zimmedar. Samjhenge woh kisi cheez par hain — kisi cheez par nahin honge.' Allah ki qasam! Darta hoon [waqt] mujhe — khaas tumhein payega; Allah ki qasam! Mujhe — khaas tumhein paye to — Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne hum se jo ahd liya, us baare mein mere-tumhare liye makhraj nahin paoon ga. Haan, jaise dakhil hua, waise nikal sakta hai.' Hasan kehte hain: Ya'ni sulah ki haalat mein."
"278","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: Aap ne farmaya: 'Waqt qareeb jab Musalman ka behtareen maal bakriyan hongi — pahadon ki chotiyon o barish ki jagahon par peeche jayega — fitne se deen lekar bhagte.'"
"279","[AI-translation] Wabishah Asadi bayan karte hain: Kufah mein ghar mein tha; suna: 'Assalamu alaikum [dakhil hoon?]' Main ne kaha: 'Wa alaikumussalam [dakhil ho].' Andar aaye to achanak Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu). Main ne kaha: 'Ae Abu Abdurrahman! Milne ka yeh kaun-sa waqt?' Dopahar thi. Unhon ne kaha: 'Din lamba hua; kisse baat karoon socha.' Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadeesein sunane lage; main bhi sunane laga. Hadees sunane lage; kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Fitna hoga; is mein soya lete se behtar; leta baithe se behtar; baitha khade se behtar; khada chalte se behtar; chalta sawar se behtar; sawar daudne wale se behtar. Is mein maare gaye sab jahannam mein.' Main ne kaha: 'Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Kab hoga?' Farmaya: ''Harj' [qatl] dinon mein hoga.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Poocha: 'Harj' din kab honge?' Farmaya: 'Jab aadmi saathi se mehfooz na hoga.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Poocha: Us waqt paoon to kya hukm dete hain?' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Jaan-haath roko; mahalle mein dakhil ho.' Main ne kaha: 'Ae Allah ke Rasul [Alaihissalam]! Mahalle mein mere paas aaye to kya raay hai?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Mere ghar mein mere paas aaye to kya raay hai?' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne farmaya: 'Masjid mein dakhil ho; aisa karo.' Nabi [Alaihissalam] ne dayan haath kalayi par rakhkar kaha: 'Mera Rabb sirf Allah hai — is par maare jaane tak.'"
"280","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hayyan bayan karte hain: Ek aadmi ne unhein walid Yahya se sunaya: Woh Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke saath the; Ibne Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne un se kaha: 'Fitne mein qatl ko kuch nahin samajhte; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do teesre ko chhodkar sargoshi na karein.'"
"281","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lashkar bhejkar ek aadmi ko ameer kiya. Us ne aag jalakar kaha: Is mein dakhil ho. Kuch ne dakhil hone ka irada kiya; doosron ne kaha: Isi [aag] se bhaage hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saamne muamla zikr kiya gaya; jinhon ne dakhil hone ka irada kiya tha — un ke baare mein farmaya: 'Dakhil hote to qiyamat tak rehte.' Doosron ke liye achhi baat kahi ya kaha: 'Achha kiya; Allah ki nafarmani mein kisi ki ita'at nahin; ita'at sirf bhalayi mein hai.'"
"282","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: Aap ne farmaya: 'Qareeb hukmaran honge — darbari-dost ghere honge; zulm karenge, jhoot bolenge. Zulm mein madad kare, jhoot mein sachcha kahe — woh mujh se nahin, main us se nahin. Jhoot mein sachcha na kahe, zulm mein madad na kare — woh mujh se hai, main us se hoon.'"
"283","[AI-translation] Hasan bayan karte hain: Ma'qil bin Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) jis marz mein wafat payi, us mein beemar hue. Haalat bhaari hui to Ibne Ziyad ghar dekhne aaya. Pehlu mein baitha to Ma'qil (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tumhein hadees sunaoon ga — Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jise logon ka nigran banaya jaaye, bhalayi se na ghere — to Allah ne zaroor us ke liye jannat ki khushbu haram ki hai; khushbu sau saal ki musafat par payi jaati hai.' Ibne Ziyad ne kaha: Aaj se pehle kyun nahin sunayi? Unhon ne kaha: Aaj bhi yeh haalat na hoti to na sunata."
"284","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qiyamat ke din Allah ko mehboobtareen, majlis mein mere qareebtareen adil hakim hoga; qiyamat ke din Allah ko mabghoozzareen, sakht azab wala zalim hakim hoga.'"
"285","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain: Aap ne farmaya: 'Qareeb sardari chahoge; qiyamat ke din hasrat-gham ka sabab hogi. Doodh pilana achha; chhudana bura.'"
"286","[AI-translation] Jahm bin Aus bayan karte hain: Abdullah bin Abi Maryam ko suna; Ubaidullah bin Rustam sawari par un ke paas se guzre. Unhon ne Ibne Abi Maryam se kaha: 'Tumhari sohbat-kalam chahta hoon.' Chale gaye to Ibne Abi Maryam ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Fajir ki nemat par hasad na karo; nahin jaante maut ke baad kya payega. Allah ke paas us ke liye aisa qatil hai — jo kabhi nahin marta.' Yeh hadees Wahb bin Munabbih ke paas pohnchi to Wahb ne Abu Dawood A'war ko bhejkar kaha: 'Ae falan! Woh amar qatil kaun hai?' Ibne Abi Maryam ne kaha: 'Maut.'"
"287","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Rehem karne walon par Rahman rehem karega. Zameen walon par rehem karo; aasman [wala] tum par rehem karega.'"
"288","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Ayesha (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai — woh Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kartin hain: Aap ne farmaya: 'Meri ummat se jo narm ho, Allah us se narm hoga; meri ummat par jo sakht ho, Allah us par sakht hoga.'"
"289","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hakim ya sardar ho to zaroor do musheer honge: ek bhalayi ka hukm kare, burayi se mana kare; [doosra] nuqsan se baaz na aaye. Jis ke sharr se mehfooz rakha gaya — woh mehfooz hai; woh donon par ghalib hai.'"
